rulings: ["[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Regenerating artifacts can regenerate from this.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The card does not go to the graveyard first.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': \'An "attacking creature" is one that has been declared as an attacker this combat, or one that was put onto the battlefield attacking this combat. Unless that creature leaves combat, it continues to be an attacking creature through the end of combat step, even if the player it was attacking has left the game, or the planeswalker it was attacking has left combat.\'}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': \'Even though Trumpet Blast affects only attacking creatures, the bonus will remain for the rest of the turn.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': "Only creatures that are attacking as Trumpet Blast resolves will receive the bonus. In other words, casting it before you\'ve declared attackers usually won\'t do anything."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': "A monocolored creature is exactly one color. Colorless creatures aren\'t monocolored."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': "A permanent that turns face up or face down changes characteristics but is otherwise the same permanent. Spells and abilities that were targeting that permanent, as well as Auras and Equipment that were attached to the permanent, aren\'t affected."}, {\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': "Any time you have priority, you may turn the face-down creature face up by revealing what its morph cost is and paying that cost. This is a special action. It doesn\'t use the stack and can\'t be responded to. Only a face-down permanent can be turned face up this way; a face-down spell cannot."}, {\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': "At any time, you can look at a face-down spell or permanent you control. You can\'t look at face-down spells or permanents you don\'t control unless an effect instructs you to do so."}, {\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': "Because the permanent is on the battlefield both before and after it\'s turned face up, turning a permanent face up doesn\'t cause any enters-the-battlefield abilities to trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': "Hooded Hydra\'s last ability isn\'t a triggered ability. It\'s a replacement ability that modifies how Hooded Hydra is turned face up. Players can\'t respond to Hooded Hydra being turned face up and having five +1/+1 counters put on it."}, {\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': "If Hooded Hydra is face down and it\'s turned face up some other way than by having its morph cost paid, the last ability will still apply."}, {\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': \'If a face-down permanent leaves the battlefield, you must reveal it. You must also reveal all face-down spells and permanents you control if you leave the game or if the game ends.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': \'Morph lets you cast a card face down by paying {3}, and lets you turn the face-down permanent face up any time you have priority by paying its morph cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': \'The face-down spell has no mana cost and has a mana value of 0. When you cast a face-down spell, put it on the stack face down so no other player knows what it is, and pay {3}. This is an alternative cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': \'Use the number of +1/+1 counters that were on Hooded Hydra the last time it was on the battlefield to determine how many Snake tokens to create.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': "When the spell resolves, it enters the battlefield as a 2/2 creature with no name, mana cost, creature types, or abilities. It\'s colorless and has a mana value of 0. Other effects that apply to the creature can still grant it any of these characteristics."}, {\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': "You must ensure that your face-down spells and permanents can easily be differentiated from each other. You\'re not allowed to mix up the cards that represent them on the battlefield in order to confuse other players. The order they entered the battlefield should remain clear. Common methods for doing this include using markers or dice, or simply placing them in order on the battlefield."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': "A permanent that turns face up or face down changes characteristics but is otherwise the same permanent. Spells and abilities that were targeting that permanent, as well as Auras and Equipment that were attached to the permanent, aren\'t affected."}, {\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': "Any time you have priority, you may turn the face-down creature face up by revealing what its morph cost is and paying that cost. This is a special action. It doesn\'t use the stack and can\'t be responded to. Only a face-down permanent can be turned face up this way; a face-down spell cannot."}, {\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': "At any time, you can look at a face-down spell or permanent you control. You can\'t look at face-down spells or permanents you don\'t control unless an effect instructs you to do so."}, {\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': "Because the permanent is on the battlefield both before and after it\'s turned face up, turning a permanent face up doesn\'t cause any enters-the-battlefield abilities to trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': "If Ashcloud Phoenix is face down, you can turn it face up for its morph cost, even if you didn\'t cast Ashcloud Phoenix face down using its morph ability."}, {\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': \'If Ashcloud Phoenix leaves the graveyard before its "dies" ability resolves, it won\\\'t return to the battlefield.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': \'If a face-down permanent leaves the battlefield, you must reveal it. You must also reveal all face-down spells and permanents you control if you leave the game or if the game ends.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': \'Morph lets you cast a card face down by paying {3}, and lets you turn the face-down permanent face up any time you have priority by paying its morph cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': "Once Ashcloud Phoenix returns to the battlefield face down, each player will know which face-down creature it is. You can\'t mix up the positions of your face-down permanents to disguise this."}, {\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': \'The face-down spell has no mana cost and has a mana value of 0. When you cast a face-down spell, put it on the stack face down so no other player knows what it is, and pay {3}. This is an alternative cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': "When the spell resolves, it enters the battlefield as a 2/2 creature with no name, mana cost, creature types, or abilities. It\'s colorless and has a mana value of 0. Other effects that apply to the creature can still grant it any of these characteristics."}, {\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': "You must ensure that your face-down spells and permanents can easily be differentiated from each other. You\'re not allowed to mix up the cards that represent them on the battlefield in order to confuse other players. The order they entered the battlefield should remain clear. Common methods for doing this include using markers or dice, or simply placing them in order on the battlefield."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': "A permanent that turns face up or face down changes characteristics but is otherwise the same permanent. Spells and abilities that were targeting that permanent, as well as Auras and Equipment that were attached to the permanent, aren\'t affected."}, {\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': "Any time you have priority, you may turn the face-down creature face up by revealing what its morph cost is and paying that cost. This is a special action. It doesn\'t use the stack and can\'t be responded to. Only a face-down permanent can be turned face up this way; a face-down spell cannot."}, {\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': "At any time, you can look at a face-down spell or permanent you control. You can\'t look at face-down spells or permanents you don\'t control unless an effect instructs you to do so."}, {\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': "Because the permanent is on the battlefield both before and after it\'s turned face up, turning a permanent face up doesn\'t cause any enters-the-battlefield abilities to trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': \'If a face-down permanent leaves the battlefield, you must reveal it. You must also reveal all face-down spells and permanents you control if you leave the game or if the game ends.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': \'Morph lets you cast a card face down by paying {3}, and lets you turn the face-down permanent face up any time you have priority by paying its morph cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': \'The face-down spell has no mana cost and has a mana value of 0. When you cast a face-down spell, put it on the stack face down so no other player knows what it is, and pay {3}. This is an alternative cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': "When the spell resolves, it enters the battlefield as a 2/2 creature with no name, mana cost, creature types, or abilities. It\'s colorless and has a mana value of 0. Other effects that apply to the creature can still grant it any of these characteristics."}, {\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': "You must ensure that your face-down spells and permanents can easily be differentiated from each other. You\'re not allowed to mix up the cards that represent them on the battlefield in order to confuse other players. The order they entered the battlefield should remain clear. Common methods for doing this include using markers or dice, or simply placing them in order on the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': \'If a face-down Mystic of the Hidden Way is blocked and then turned face up, it stays blocked.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': "A permanent that turns face up or face down changes characteristics but is otherwise the same permanent. Spells and abilities that were targeting that permanent, as well as Auras and Equipment that were attached to the permanent, aren\'t affected."}, {\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': "Any time you have priority, you may turn the face-down creature face up by revealing what its morph cost is and paying that cost. This is a special action. It doesn\'t use the stack and can\'t be responded to. Only a face-down permanent can be turned face up this way; a face-down spell cannot."}, {\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': "At any time, you can look at a face-down spell or permanent you control. You can\'t look at face-down spells or permanents you don\'t control unless an effect instructs you to do so."}, {\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': "Because the permanent is on the battlefield both before and after it\'s turned face up, turning a permanent face up doesn\'t cause any enters-the-battlefield abilities to trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': \'If a face-down permanent leaves the battlefield, you must reveal it. You must also reveal all face-down spells and permanents you control if you leave the game or if the game ends.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': \'Morph lets you cast a card face down by paying {3}, and lets you turn the face-down permanent face up any time you have priority by paying its morph cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': \'The face-down spell has no mana cost and has a mana value of 0. When you cast a face-down spell, put it on the stack face down so no other player knows what it is, and pay {3}. This is an alternative cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': "When the spell resolves, it enters the battlefield as a 2/2 creature with no name, mana cost, creature types, or abilities. It\'s colorless and has a mana value of 0. Other effects that apply to the creature can still grant it any of these characteristics."}, {\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': "You must ensure that your face-down spells and permanents can easily be differentiated from each other. You\'re not allowed to mix up the cards that represent them on the battlefield in order to confuse other players. The order they entered the battlefield should remain clear. Common methods for doing this include using markers or dice, or simply placing them in order on the battlefield."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': "A spell or ability that counters spells can still target a creature spell you control. When that spell or ability resolves, the creature spell won\'t be countered, but any additional effects of that spell or ability will still happen."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': "Any spell you cast that doesn\'t have the type creature will cause prowess to trigger. If a spell has multiple types, and one of those types is creature (such as an artifact creature), casting it won\'t cause prowess to trigger. Playing a land also won\'t cause prowess to trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': "Once it triggers, prowess isn\'t connected to the spell that caused it to trigger. If that spell is countered, prowess will still resolve."}, {\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': \'Prowess goes on the stack on top of the spell that caused it to trigger. It will resolve before that spell.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "You draw a card and discard a card all while Jeskai Elder\'s ability is resolving. Nothing can happen between the two, and no player may choose to take actions."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': "Any spell you cast that doesn\'t have the type creature will cause prowess to trigger. If a spell has multiple types, and one of those types is creature (such as an artifact creature), casting it won\'t cause prowess to trigger. Playing a land also won\'t cause prowess to trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': "Once it triggers, prowess isn\'t connected to the spell that caused it to trigger. If that spell is countered, prowess will still resolve."}, {\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': \'Prowess goes on the stack on top of the spell that caused it to trigger. It will resolve before that spell.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'An ability that triggers when a player casts a spell resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': "Deflecting Palm doesn\'t target any permanent or player. You choose a source of damage as Deflecting Palm resolves."}, {\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': \'If multiple prevention and/or replacement effects are trying to apply to the same damage, the player who would be dealt damage chooses the order in which to apply them.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': "High Sentinels of Arashin gets +1/+1 per creature, not per +1/+1 counter. It doesn\'t matter how many +1/+1 counters are on any other creature you control as long as there\'s one or more."}, {\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': \'The activated ability can target and put +1/+1 counters on High Sentinels of Arashin itself.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': "If you choose the third mode, you choose how the counters will be distributed as you cast the spell. Notably, if you choose to put one +1/+1 counter on each of two target creatures, and one of those creatures becomes an illegal target in response, the +1/+1 counter that would have been put on that creature is lost. It can\'t be put on the remaining legal target."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': "You decide which creature to spare as Duneblast resolves. This choice doesn\'t target the creature. If you don\'t choose a creature, then all creatures will be destroyed."}]', "[{'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'A permanent that turns face up or face down changes characteristics but is otherwise the same permanent. Spells and abilities that were targeting that permanent, as well as Auras and Equipment that were attached to the permanent, aren’t affected.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Although turning a face-down creature with morph face up doesn’t use the stack, Rattleclaw Mystic’s triggered ability does use the stack, and players can respond to that ability. Notably, you can’t turn Rattleclaw Mystic face up while casting a spell or activating an ability. You’ll need to turn Rattleclaw Mystic face up and have its triggered ability resolve before you can spend that mana.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Any time you have priority, you may turn the face-down creature face up by revealing what its morph cost is and paying that cost. This is a special action. It doesn’t use the stack and can’t be responded to. Only a face-down permanent can be turned face up this way; a face-down spell cannot.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'At any time, you can look at a face-down spell or permanent you control. You can’t look at face-down spells or permanents you don’t control unless an effect instructs you to do so.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Because the permanent is on the battlefield both before and after it’s turned face up, turning a permanent face up doesn’t cause any enters-the-battlefield abilities to trigger.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'If a face-down permanent leaves the battlefield, you must reveal it. You must also reveal all face-down spells and permanents you control if you leave the game or if the game ends.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Morph lets you cast a card face down by paying {3}, and lets you turn the face-down permanent face up any time you have priority by paying its morph cost.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'The face-down spell has no mana cost and has a converted mana cost of 0. When you cast a face-down spell, put it on the stack face down so no other player knows what it is, and pay {3}. This is an alternative cost.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'When the spell resolves, it enters the battlefield as a 2/2 creature with no name, mana cost, creature types, or abilities. It’s colorless and has a converted mana cost of 0. Other effects that apply to the creature can still grant it any of these characteristics.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'You must ensure that your face-down spells and permanents can easily be differentiated from each other. You’re not allowed to mix up the cards that represent them on the battlefield in order to confuse other players. The order they entered the battlefield should remain clear. Common methods for doing this include using markers or dice, or simply placing them in order on the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'A permanent that turns face up or face down changes characteristics but is otherwise the same permanent. Spells and abilities that were targeting that permanent, as well as Auras and Equipment that were attached to the permanent, aren’t affected.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Any time you have priority, you may turn the face-down creature face up by revealing what its morph cost is and paying that cost. This is a special action. It doesn’t use the stack and can’t be responded to. Only a face-down permanent can be turned face up this way; a face-down spell cannot.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'At any time, you can look at a face-down spell or permanent you control. You can’t look at face-down spells or permanents you don’t control unless an effect instructs you to do so.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Because the permanent is on the battlefield both before and after it’s turned face up, turning a permanent face up doesn’t cause any enters-the-battlefield abilities to trigger.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Because you’re already casting the card using an alternative cost (by casting it without paying its mana cost), you can’t pay any other alternative costs for the card, including casting it face down using the morph ability. You can pay additional costs, such as kicker costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, you must pay those.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'If a face-down permanent leaves the battlefield, you must reveal it. You must also reveal all face-down spells and permanents you control if you leave the game or if the game ends.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'If the card has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value for X when casting it.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Morph lets you cast a card face down by paying {3}, and lets you turn the face-down permanent face up any time you have priority by paying its morph cost.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'The face-down spell has no mana cost and has a converted mana cost of 0. When you cast a face-down spell, put it on the stack face down so no other player knows what it is, and pay {3}. This is an alternative cost.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'When the spell resolves, it enters the battlefield as a 2/2 creature with no name, mana cost, creature types, or abilities. It’s colorless and has a converted mana cost of 0. Other effects that apply to the creature can still grant it any of these characteristics.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'You can target a spell you control with Kheru Spellsnatcher’s triggered ability. This will give you the ability to cast the card later without paying its mana cost.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'You must ensure that your face-down spells and permanents can easily be differentiated from each other. You’re not allowed to mix up the cards that represent them on the battlefield in order to confuse other players. The order they entered the battlefield should remain clear. Common methods for doing this include using markers or dice, or simply placing them in order on the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'A permanent that turns face up or face down changes characteristics but is otherwise the same permanent. Spells and abilities that were targeting that permanent, as well as Auras and Equipment that were attached to the permanent, aren’t affected.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Any time you have priority, you may turn the face-down creature face up by revealing what its morph cost is and paying that cost. This is a special action. It doesn’t use the stack and can’t be responded to. Only a face-down permanent can be turned face up this way; a face-down spell cannot.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'At any time, you can look at a face-down spell or permanent you control. You can’t look at face-down spells or permanents you don’t control unless an effect instructs you to do so.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Because the permanent is on the battlefield both before and after it’s turned face up, turning a permanent face up doesn’t cause any enters-the-battlefield abilities to trigger.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Gaining control of a creature doesn’t cause you to gain control of any Auras or Equipment attached to that creature.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'If a face-down permanent leaves the battlefield, you must reveal it. You must also reveal all face-down spells and permanents you control if you leave the game or if the game ends.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Jeering Instigator’s last ability can target any creature, even one that’s untapped or one you already control.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Morph lets you cast a card face down by paying {3}, and lets you turn the face-down permanent face up any time you have priority by paying its morph cost.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'The face-down spell has no mana cost and has a converted mana cost of 0. When you cast a face-down spell, put it on the stack face down so no other player knows what it is, and pay {3}. This is an alternative cost.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'When the spell resolves, it enters the battlefield as a 2/2 creature with no name, mana cost, creature types, or abilities. It’s colorless and has a converted mana cost of 0. Other effects that apply to the creature can still grant it any of these characteristics.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'You must ensure that your face-down spells and permanents can easily be differentiated from each other. You’re not allowed to mix up the cards that represent them on the battlefield in order to confuse other players. The order they entered the battlefield should remain clear. Common methods for doing this include using markers or dice, or simply placing them in order on the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'A permanent that turns face up or face down changes characteristics but is otherwise the same permanent. Spells and abilities that were targeting that permanent, as well as Auras and Equipment that were attached to the permanent, aren’t affected.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Any time you have priority, you may turn the face-down creature face up by revealing what its morph cost is and paying that cost. This is a special action. It doesn’t use the stack and can’t be responded to. Only a face-down permanent can be turned face up this way; a face-down spell cannot.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'At any time, you can look at a face-down spell or permanent you control. You can’t look at face-down spells or permanents you don’t control unless an effect instructs you to do so.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Because the permanent is on the battlefield both before and after it’s turned face up, turning a permanent face up doesn’t cause any enters-the-battlefield abilities to trigger.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'If a face-down Horde Ambusher blocks and is then turned face up, its first ability won’t trigger because it didn’t have that ability when it blocked.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'If a face-down permanent leaves the battlefield, you must reveal it. You must also reveal all face-down spells and permanents you control if you leave the game or if the game ends.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Morph lets you cast a card face down by paying {3}, and lets you turn the face-down permanent face up any time you have priority by paying its morph cost.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'The face-down spell has no mana cost and has a converted mana cost of 0. When you cast a face-down spell, put it on the stack face down so no other player knows what it is, and pay {3}. This is an alternative cost.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Turning Horde Ambusher face up after blockers have been declared won’t remove any creature from combat or change how any creature is blocking.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'When the spell resolves, it enters the battlefield as a 2/2 creature with no name, mana cost, creature types, or abilities. It’s colorless and has a converted mana cost of 0. Other effects that apply to the creature can still grant it any of these characteristics.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'You must ensure that your face-down spells and permanents can easily be differentiated from each other. You’re not allowed to mix up the cards that represent them on the battlefield in order to confuse other players. The order they entered the battlefield should remain clear. Common methods for doing this include using markers or dice, or simply placing them in order on the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'A permanent that turns face up or face down changes characteristics but is otherwise the same permanent. Spells and abilities that were targeting that permanent, as well as Auras and Equipment that were attached to the permanent, aren’t affected.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Any time you have priority, you may turn the face-down creature face up by revealing what its morph cost is and paying that cost. This is a special action. It doesn’t use the stack and can’t be responded to. Only a face-down permanent can be turned face up this way; a face-down spell cannot.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'At any time, you can look at a face-down spell or permanent you control. You can’t look at face-down spells or permanents you don’t control unless an effect instructs you to do so.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Because the permanent is on the battlefield both before and after it’s turned face up, turning a permanent face up doesn’t cause any enters-the-battlefield abilities to trigger.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'If a face-down creature other than Pine Walker is turned face up and the resulting permanent isn’t a creature, Pine Walker’s last ability won’t trigger.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'If a face-down permanent leaves the battlefield, you must reveal it. You must also reveal all face-down spells and permanents you control if you leave the game or if the game ends.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Morph lets you cast a card face down by paying {3}, and lets you turn the face-down permanent face up any time you have priority by paying its morph cost.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'The face-down spell has no mana cost and has a converted mana cost of 0. When you cast a face-down spell, put it on the stack face down so no other player knows what it is, and pay {3}. This is an alternative cost.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'When the spell resolves, it enters the battlefield as a 2/2 creature with no name, mana cost, creature types, or abilities. It’s colorless and has a converted mana cost of 0. Other effects that apply to the creature can still grant it any of these characteristics.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'You must ensure that your face-down spells and permanents can easily be differentiated from each other. You’re not allowed to mix up the cards that represent them on the battlefield in order to confuse other players. The order they entered the battlefield should remain clear. Common methods for doing this include using markers or dice, or simply placing them in order on the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'A permanent that turns face up or face down changes characteristics but is otherwise the same permanent. Spells and abilities that were targeting that permanent, as well as Auras and Equipment that were attached to the permanent, aren’t affected.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Any time you have priority, you may turn the face-down creature face up by revealing what its morph cost is and paying that cost. This is a special action. It doesn’t use the stack and can’t be responded to. Only a face-down permanent can be turned face up this way; a face-down spell cannot.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'At any time, you can look at a face-down spell or permanent you control. You can’t look at face-down spells or permanents you don’t control unless an effect instructs you to do so.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Because the permanent is on the battlefield both before and after it’s turned face up, turning a permanent face up doesn’t cause any enters-the-battlefield abilities to trigger.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'If a face-down permanent leaves the battlefield, you must reveal it. You must also reveal all face-down spells and permanents you control if you leave the game or if the game ends.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'If an attacking face-down Monastery Flock is turned face up, it will continue to be attacking even though it will have defender. If it’s turned face up before blockers are declared, then creatures without flying or reach won’t be able to block it.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Morph lets you cast a card face down by paying {3}, and lets you turn the face-down permanent face up any time you have priority by paying its morph cost.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'The face-down spell has no mana cost and has a converted mana cost of 0. When you cast a face-down spell, put it on the stack face down so no other player knows what it is, and pay {3}. This is an alternative cost.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'When the spell resolves, it enters the battlefield as a 2/2 creature with no name, mana cost, creature types, or abilities. It’s colorless and has a converted mana cost of 0. Other effects that apply to the creature can still grant it any of these characteristics.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'You must ensure that your face-down spells and permanents can easily be differentiated from each other. You’re not allowed to mix up the cards that represent them on the battlefield in order to confuse other players. The order they entered the battlefield should remain clear. Common methods for doing this include using markers or dice, or simply placing them in order on the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'A permanent that turns face up or face down changes characteristics but is otherwise the same permanent. Spells and abilities that were targeting that permanent, as well as Auras and Equipment that were attached to the permanent, aren’t affected.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Any time you have priority, you may turn the face-down creature face up by revealing what its morph cost is and paying that cost. This is a special action. It doesn’t use the stack and can’t be responded to. Only a face-down permanent can be turned face up this way; a face-down spell cannot.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'At any time, you can look at a face-down spell or permanent you control. You can’t look at face-down spells or permanents you don’t control unless an effect instructs you to do so.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Because the permanent is on the battlefield both before and after it’s turned face up, turning a permanent face up doesn’t cause any enters-the-battlefield abilities to trigger.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'If a face-down permanent leaves the battlefield, you must reveal it. You must also reveal all face-down spells and permanents you control if you leave the game or if the game ends.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'If you control the only other creatures when Icefeather Aven is turned face up, you must target one of them. You choose whether that creature is returned to its owner’s hand as the ability resolves.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Morph lets you cast a card face down by paying {3}, and lets you turn the face-down permanent face up any time you have priority by paying its morph cost.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'The face-down spell has no mana cost and has a converted mana cost of 0. When you cast a face-down spell, put it on the stack face down so no other player knows what it is, and pay {3}. This is an alternative cost.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'When the spell resolves, it enters the battlefield as a 2/2 creature with no name, mana cost, creature types, or abilities. It’s colorless and has a converted mana cost of 0. Other effects that apply to the creature can still grant it any of these characteristics.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'You must ensure that your face-down spells and permanents can easily be differentiated from each other. You’re not allowed to mix up the cards that represent them on the battlefield in order to confuse other players. The order they entered the battlefield should remain clear. Common methods for doing this include using markers or dice, or simply placing them in order on the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'A permanent that turns face up or face down changes characteristics but is otherwise the same permanent. Spells and abilities that were targeting that permanent, as well as Auras and Equipment that were attached to the permanent, aren’t affected.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Any time you have priority, you may turn the face-down creature face up by revealing what its morph cost is and paying that cost. This is a special action. It doesn’t use the stack and can’t be responded to. Only a face-down permanent can be turned face up this way; a face-down spell cannot.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'At any time, you can look at a face-down spell or permanent you control. You can’t look at face-down spells or permanents you don’t control unless an effect instructs you to do so.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Because the permanent is on the battlefield both before and after it’s turned face up, turning a permanent face up doesn’t cause any enters-the-battlefield abilities to trigger.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'If a face-down permanent leaves the battlefield, you must reveal it. You must also reveal all face-down spells and permanents you control if you leave the game or if the game ends.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'It doesn’t matter if Thousand Winds is tapped or untapped (or even on the battlefield) when its last ability resolves. Tapped creatures except Thousand Winds will be returned to their owners’ hands.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Morph lets you cast a card face down by paying {3}, and lets you turn the face-down permanent face up any time you have priority by paying its morph cost.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'The face-down spell has no mana cost and has a converted mana cost of 0. When you cast a face-down spell, put it on the stack face down so no other player knows what it is, and pay {3}. This is an alternative cost.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'When the spell resolves, it enters the battlefield as a 2/2 creature with no name, mana cost, creature types, or abilities. It’s colorless and has a converted mana cost of 0. Other effects that apply to the creature can still grant it any of these characteristics.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'You must ensure that your face-down spells and permanents can easily be differentiated from each other. You’re not allowed to mix up the cards that represent them on the battlefield in order to confuse other players. The order they entered the battlefield should remain clear. Common methods for doing this include using markers or dice, or simply placing them in order on the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'A permanent that turns face up or face down changes characteristics but is otherwise the same permanent. Spells and abilities that were targeting that permanent, as well as Auras and Equipment that were attached to the permanent, aren’t affected.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Any time you have priority, you may turn the face-down creature face up by revealing what its morph cost is and paying that cost. This is a special action. It doesn’t use the stack and can’t be responded to. Only a face-down permanent can be turned face up this way; a face-down spell cannot.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'At any time, you can look at a face-down spell or permanent you control. You can’t look at face-down spells or permanents you don’t control unless an effect instructs you to do so.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Because the permanent is on the battlefield both before and after it’s turned face up, turning a permanent face up doesn’t cause any enters-the-battlefield abilities to trigger.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'If a face-down permanent leaves the battlefield, you must reveal it. You must also reveal all face-down spells and permanents you control if you leave the game or if the game ends.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Morph lets you cast a card face down by paying {3}, and lets you turn the face-down permanent face up any time you have priority by paying its morph cost.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'The face-down spell has no mana cost and has a converted mana cost of 0. When you cast a face-down spell, put it on the stack face down so no other player knows what it is, and pay {3}. This is an alternative cost.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'When the spell resolves, it enters the battlefield as a 2/2 creature with no name, mana cost, creature types, or abilities. It’s colorless and has a converted mana cost of 0. Other effects that apply to the creature can still grant it any of these characteristics.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'You must ensure that your face-down spells and permanents can easily be differentiated from each other. You’re not allowed to mix up the cards that represent them on the battlefield in order to confuse other players. The order they entered the battlefield should remain clear. Common methods for doing this include using markers or dice, or simply placing them in order on the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'A permanent that turns face up or face down changes characteristics but is otherwise the same permanent. Spells and abilities that were targeting that permanent, as well as Auras and Equipment that were attached to the permanent, aren’t affected.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Any time you have priority, you may turn the face-down creature face up by revealing what its morph cost is and paying that cost. This is a special action. It doesn’t use the stack and can’t be responded to. Only a face-down permanent can be turned face up this way; a face-down spell cannot.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'At any time, you can look at a face-down spell or permanent you control. You can’t look at face-down spells or permanents you don’t control unless an effect instructs you to do so.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Because the permanent is on the battlefield both before and after it’s turned face up, turning a permanent face up doesn’t cause any enters-the-battlefield abilities to trigger.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'If a face-down permanent leaves the battlefield, you must reveal it. You must also reveal all face-down spells and permanents you control if you leave the game or if the game ends.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Morph lets you cast a card face down by paying {3}, and lets you turn the face-down permanent face up any time you have priority by paying its morph cost.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'The face-down spell has no mana cost and has a mana value of 0. When you cast a face-down spell, put it on the stack face down so no other player knows what it is, and pay {3}. This is an alternative cost.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'When the spell resolves, it enters the battlefield as a 2/2 creature with no name, mana cost, creature types, or abilities. It’s colorless and has a mana value of 0. Other effects that apply to the creature can still grant it any of these characteristics.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'You must ensure that your face-down spells and permanents can easily be differentiated from each other. You’re not allowed to mix up the cards that represent them on the battlefield in order to confuse other players. The order they entered the battlefield should remain clear. Common methods for doing this include using markers or dice, or simply placing them in order on the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'A spell or ability that counters spells can still target Pearl Lake Ancient. When one resolves, Pearl Lake Ancient won’t be countered, but any additional effects of that spell or ability will still happen.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Any spell you cast that doesn’t have the type creature will cause prowess to trigger. If a spell has multiple types, and one of those types is creature (such as an artifact creature), casting it won’t cause prowess to trigger. Playing a land also won’t cause prowess to trigger.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Once it triggers, prowess isn’t connected to the spell that caused it to trigger. If that spell is countered, prowess will still resolve.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Prowess goes on the stack on top of the spell that caused it to trigger. It will resolve before that spell.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Activating Leaping Master’s ability after it’s been blocked won’t change or undo the block.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Activating the ability targeting a creature that’s already attacking or blocking won’t remove it from combat or affect that attack or block.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'If Briber’s Purse has no gem counters on it, it remains on the battlefield, although you can’t activate its last ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Although the tokens are attacking, they were never declared as attacking creatures (for purposes of abilities that trigger whenever a creature attacks, for example).'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'As the Goblin token enters the battlefield, you choose which opponent or opposing planeswalker it’s attacking. It doesn’t have to attack the same opponent or opposing planeswalker that the original creature is attacking.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'An “extra turn” is any turn created by a spell or ability. Notably, it doesn’t include additional turns taken in tournaments after time expires for a round.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Extra turns can still be created while Ugin’s Nexus is on the battlefield. They’re not skipped until they would begin, so if Ugin’s Nexus leaves the battlefield before that happens, the extra turns will be unaffected. Notably, if you control more than one Ugin’s Nexus, all but one will be exiled and an extra turn created for each. If the Ugin’s Nexus that remains on the battlefield isn’t on the battlefield when each of those extra turns would begin, you can take those turns.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Anafenza’s first ability can target any tapped creature you control. That creature doesn’t necessarily have to be attacking.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Anafenza’s last ability cares only what the card would be in the zone it’s moving from, not what it would be in the graveyard. For example, if a land card you control becomes a creature due to an effect and then dies, the land card will be exiled. But if a creature card with bestow is an Aura when it would be put into the graveyard, it ends up in the graveyard.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'If your opponent discards a creature card while Anafenza is on the battlefield, abilities that function when a card is discarded (such as madness) still work, even though that card never reaches a graveyard. In addition, spells or abilities that check the characteristics of a discarded card (such as Chandra Ablaze’s first ability) can find that card in exile.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'While Anafenza is on the battlefield, abilities that trigger whenever a nontoken creature your opponent owns dies won’t trigger, as that card will never reach that player’s graveyard. (Token creatures will still go to the graveyard briefly before ceasing to exist.)'}]", "[{'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Any enters-the-battlefield abilities of the chosen permanent will trigger when Clever Impersonator enters the battlefield. Any “as [this permanent] enters the battlefield” or “[this permanent] enters the battlefield with” abilities of the chosen permanent will also work.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Clever Impersonator copies exactly what is printed on the chosen permanent (unless that permanent is copying something else or is a token; see below). It doesn’t copy whether that permanent is tapped or untapped, whether that permanent has any counters on it or any Auras and/or Equipment attached to it, and it doesn’t copy any non-copy effects that have changed that permanent’s power, toughness, types, color, abilities, or so on.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'If Clever Impersonator enters the battlefield as a copy of a planeswalker, it will enter the battlefield with a number of loyalty counters on it equal to the loyalty printed in the lower right corner of the planeswalker card. It won’t copy the number of loyalty counters on the original planeswalker.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'If Clever Impersonator enters the battlefield at the same time as another permanent, it can’t become a copy of that permanent. You may choose only a nonland permanent that’s already on the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'If the chosen permanent has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'If the chosen permanent is a copy of something else (for example, if the chosen permanent is another Clever Impersonator), then your Clever Impersonator enters the battlefield as whatever the chosen permanent copied.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'If the chosen permanent is a token, Clever Impersonator copies the original characteristics of that token as defined by the effect that put that token onto the battlefield. Clever Impersonator is not a token.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Remember that if you control more than one legendary permanent with the same name, you’ll choose one to remain on the battlefield and put the rest into their owner’s graveyard.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'You can choose not to copy anything. In that case, Clever Impersonator enters the battlefield as a 0/0 creature, and it’s put into the graveyard immediately (unless something is raising its toughness above 0).'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'You choose which nonland permanent Clever Impersonator will copy, if any, as it enters the battlefield. This doesn’t target that nonland permanent.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Any exiled cards you don’t cast remain in exile.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Because you’re already casting the card using an alternative cost (by casting it without paying its mana cost), you can’t pay any other alternative costs for the card, including casting it face down using the morph ability. You can pay additional costs, such as kicker costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, you must pay those.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'If the card has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value for X when casting it.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'The cards are exiled face up. Casting the noncreature cards exiled this way follows the normal rules for casting those cards. You must follow all applicable timing rules. For example, if one of the exiled cards is a sorcery card, you can cast it only during your main phase while the stack is empty.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'You can’t play any land cards exiled with Narset.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Any instruction, including Sidisi’s first ability, that tells you to put multiple cards from a library into a graveyard moves all the cards at the same time. For example, if Sidisi enters the battlefield and you put three creature cards into your graveyard, Sidisi’s last ability will trigger once and you’ll put one Zombie token onto the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Sidisi’s last ability triggers any time creature cards are put into your graveyard from anywhere in your library, not just from the top.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Any loyalty counters on Sarkhan when his first ability resolves will remain on him while he’s a creature. Because he’s not a planeswalker at this time, damage dealt to him won’t cause those counters to be removed.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'If Sarkhan, the Dragonspeaker becomes a creature due to his first ability, that doesn’t count as having a creature enter the battlefield. Sarkhan was already on the battlefield; he only changed his types. Abilities that trigger whenever a creature enters the battlefield won’t trigger.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'If a permanent enters the battlefield as a copy of Sarkhan after his first ability has resolved, the copy will be a Sarkhan planeswalker. It will enter the battlefield with four loyalty counters, no matter how many loyalty counters are on the original Sarkhan. You’ll then find yourself in the same situation described above.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Any spell you cast that doesn’t have the type creature will cause prowess to trigger. If a spell has multiple types, and one of those types is creature (such as an artifact creature), casting it won’t cause prowess to trigger. Playing a land also won’t cause prowess to trigger.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Once it triggers, prowess isn’t connected to the spell that caused it to trigger. If that spell is countered, prowess will still resolve.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Prowess goes on the stack on top of the spell that caused it to trigger. It will resolve before that spell.'}, {'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'Multiple instances of lifelink on the same creature are redundant.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Any spell you cast that doesn’t have the type creature will cause prowess to trigger. If a spell has multiple types, and one of those types is creature (such as an artifact creature), casting it won’t cause prowess to trigger. Playing a land also won’t cause prowess to trigger.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Once it triggers, prowess isn’t connected to the spell that caused it to trigger. If that spell is countered, prowess will still resolve.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Prowess goes on the stack on top of the spell that caused it to trigger. It will resolve before that spell.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'As Meandering Towershell returns to the battlefield because of the delayed triggered ability, you choose which opponent or opposing planeswalker it’s attacking. It doesn’t have to attack the same opponent or opposing planeswalker that it was when it was exiled.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'If Meandering Towershell enters the battlefield attacking, it wasn’t declared as an attacking creature that turn. Abilities that trigger when a creature attacks, including its own triggered ability, won’t trigger.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'If you attack with a Meandering Towershell that you don’t own, you’ll control it when it returns to the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'On the turn Meandering Towershell attacks and is exiled, raid abilities will see it as a creature that attacked. Conversely, on the turn Meandering Towershell enters the battlefield attacking, raid abilities will not.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'As soon as a creature turns face up, it loses the +0/+1 from Secret Plans. If damage marked on that creature is equal to or greater than its new toughness, the creature will be destroyed.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Assuming the ferocious ability applies, if just the creature you control is an illegal target when Savage Punch tries to resolve, it won’t get +2/+2 until end of turn. If the creature you control is a legal target but the creature you don’t control isn’t, the creature you control will get +2/+2 until end of turn.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Ferocious abilities of instants and sorceries that don’t use the word “instead” will provide an additional effect if you control a creature with power 4 or greater as they resolve.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'If either target is an illegal target when Savage Punch tries to resolve, neither creature will deal or be dealt damage.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Some ferocious abilities that appear on instants and sorceries use the word “instead.” These spells have an upgraded effect if you control a creature with power 4 or greater as they resolve. For these, you only get the upgraded effect, not both effects.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'You can’t cast Savage Punch unless you target both a creature you control and a creature you don’t control.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Auras attached to the exiled creature will be put into their owners’ graveyards. Equipment attached to the exiled creature will become unattached and remain on the battlefield. Any counters on the exiled creature will cease to exist.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'If Suspension Field leaves the battlefield before its enters-the-battlefield ability resolves, the target creature won’t be exiled.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'If a token is exiled this way, it ceases to exist. It won’t be returned to the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'If the target creature becomes an illegal target before the ability resolves, perhaps because its toughness was lowered, the ability won’t resolve and none of its effects will happen. No creature will be exiled, and Suspension Field will remain on the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'In a multiplayer game, if Suspension Field’s owner leaves the game, the exiled card will return to the battlefield. Because the one-shot effect that returns the card isn’t an ability that goes on the stack, it won’t cease to exist along with the leaving player’s spells and abilities on the stack.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Suspension Field’s ability causes a zone change with a duration. It’s a single ability that creates two one-shot effects: one that exiles the creature when the ability resolves, and another that returns the exiled card to the battlefield immediately after Suspension Field leaves the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'The exiled card returns to the battlefield immediately after Suspension Field leaves the battlefield. Nothing happens between these two events, including state-based actions. Suspension Field and the returned card aren’t on the battlefield at the same time.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Barrage of Boulders deals damage only to creatures you don’t control as it resolves. However, the ferocious ability affects all creatures, including ones you control and ones that weren’t on the battlefield as Barrage of Boulders resolved.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Ferocious abilities of instants and sorceries that don’t use the word “instead” will provide an additional effect if you control a creature with power 4 or greater as they resolve.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Some ferocious abilities that appear on instants and sorceries use the word “instead.” These spells have an upgraded effect if you control a creature with power 4 or greater as they resolve. For these, you only get the upgraded effect, not both effects.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Because delve isn’t an alternative cost, it can be used in conjunction with alternative costs.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Dead Drop doesn’t target any creature. The target player could sacrifice a creature with hexproof, for example.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Delve doesn’t change a spell’s mana cost or converted mana cost. For example, Dead Drop’s converted mana cost is 10 even if you exiled three cards to cast it.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'The rules for delve have changed slightly since it was last in an expansion. Previously, delve reduced the cost to cast a spell. Under the current rules, you exile cards from your graveyard at the same time you pay the spell’s cost. Exiling a card this way is simply another way to pay that cost.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'The target player chooses which creatures they will sacrifice as Dead Drop resolves. If the player controls only one creature at that time, they will sacrifice it.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'You can’t exile cards to pay for the colored mana requirements of a spell with delve.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'You can’t exile more cards than the generic mana requirement of a spell with delve. For example, you can’t exile more than nine cards from your graveyard to cast Dead Drop.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Because delve isn’t an alternative cost, it can be used in conjunction with alternative costs.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Delve doesn’t change a spell’s mana cost or converted mana cost. For example, Dead Drop’s converted mana cost is 10 even if you exiled three cards to cast it.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'The rules for delve have changed slightly since it was last in an expansion. Previously, delve reduced the cost to cast a spell. Under the current rules, you exile cards from your graveyard at the same time you pay the spell’s cost. Exiling a card this way is simply another way to pay that cost.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'You can’t exile cards to pay for the colored mana requirements of a spell with delve.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'You can’t exile more cards than the generic mana requirement of a spell with delve. For example, you can’t exile more than nine cards from your graveyard to cast Dead Drop.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Because the ability doesn’t target any creature card, any creature card (including Kheru Lich Lord itself) put into the graveyard in response to that ability may be returned to the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'If a creature card returned to the battlefield with Kheru Lich Lord would leave the battlefield for any reason, it’s exiled instead. However, if that creature is already being exiled, then the replacement effect won’t apply. If the spell or ability that exiles it later returns it to the battlefield (as Suspension Field might, for example), the creature card will return to the battlefield as a new object with no relation to its previous existence. The effects from Kheru Lich Lord will no longer apply to it.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Kheru Lich Lord grants flying, trample, and haste to the creature that’s returned to the battlefield. However, neither of the “exile” abilities is granted to that creature. If that creature loses all its abilities, it will still be exiled at the beginning of your next end step, and if it would leave the battlefield, it is still exiled instead.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'The ability that exiles the card at the beginning of your next end step is a delayed triggered ability. If the delayed triggered ability is countered, the creature will stay on the battlefield and the ability won’t trigger again. However, the replacement effect will still exile the creature when it eventually leaves the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'The creature card returned to the battlefield is chosen at random as the ability resolves. If any player responds to the ability, that player won’t yet know what card will be returned.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'The exiled creature is never put into the graveyard. Any abilities the creature has that trigger when it dies won’t trigger.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'You decide whether to pay {2}{B} as the ability resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Because you’re not casting the creature cards, you can’t pay any additional or alternative costs. You can’t put the cards onto the battlefield face down.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Ferocious abilities of instants and sorceries that don’t use the word “instead” will provide an additional effect if you control a creature with power 4 or greater as they resolve.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'If a card you put onto the battlefield this way has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Some ferocious abilities that appear on instants and sorceries use the word “instead.” These spells have an upgraded effect if you control a creature with power 4 or greater as they resolve. For these, you only get the upgraded effect, not both effects.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'You determine whether the ferocious ability applies before any creature cards are put onto the battlefield. If you put two creature cards onto the battlefield this way, those creatures enter the battlefield at the same time.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Blinding Spray doesn’t affect creatures that enter the battlefield or come under the control of one of your opponents after it resolves.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'You can cast Blinding Spray even if your opponents control no creatures just to draw a card.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Controlling more than one Ivorytusk Fortress doesn’t allow you to untap any creature more than once during a single untap step.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Each creature you control with a +1/+1 counter on it untaps at the same time as the active player’s permanents. You can’t choose to not untap them at that time.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Effects that state a creature you control doesn’t untap during your untap step won’t apply during another player’s untap step.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Count the number of attacking creatures when the last ability resolves, including Wingmate Roc itself if it’s still on the battlefield, to determine how much life you gain.'}, {'date': '2018-01-19', 'text': 'Raid abilities care only that you attacked with a creature. It doesn’t matter how many creatures you attacked with, or which opponent or planeswalker controlled by an opponent those creatures attacked.'}, {'date': '2018-01-19', 'text': 'Raid abilities evaluate the entire turn to see if you attacked with a creature. That creature doesn’t have to still be on the battlefield. Similarly, the player or planeswalker it attacked doesn’t have to still be in the game or on the battlefield, respectively.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Count the number of colorless creatures you control (including face-down creatures) as the last ability resolves to determine how much life you gain.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Crackling Doom doesn’t target any player or creature. For example, a creature with protection from black could be sacrificed.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'If a player controls two or more creatures tied for the greatest power among creatures they control, that player chooses one of them to sacrifice.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'In a multiplayer game, each opponent, starting with the active player and proceeding in turn order, chooses which creature they will sacrifice and then all creatures are sacrificed at the same time. Each successive player will know what the players before them chose to sacrifice.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'The sacrifice is not dependent on the damage being dealt. It doesn’t matter if that damage is prevented or redirected.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Dragonscale Boon can target any creature, including one that’s already untapped.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Each copy will have the same targets as the spell it’s copying unless you choose new ones. You may change any number of the targets, including all of them or none of them. If, for one of the targets, you can’t choose a new legal target, then it remains unchanged (even if the current target is illegal). You can choose different targets for each copy.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Howl of the Horde creates a delayed triggered ability that triggers when you cast your next instant or sorcery spell that turn. The raid ability creates a second, identical delayed triggered ability. Each of these will create a single copy of the next instant or sorcery spell you cast during that turn. If you don’t cast another instant or sorcery spell during that turn, both delayed triggered abilities will cease to exist.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'If the spell being copied has an X whose value was determined as it was cast (like Crater’s Claws has), each copy will have the same value of X.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'If the spell being copied is modal (that is, it says “Choose one —” or the like), each copy will have the same mode. You can’t choose a different one.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'The delayed triggered abilities will copy any instant or sorcery spell, not just one with targets.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'When either ability resolves, it creates a copy of the instant or sorcery spell. You control each copy. Each copy is created on the stack, so it’s not “cast.” Abilities that trigger when a player casts a spell won’t trigger. The copy or copies will then resolve like normal spells, after players get a chance to cast spells and activate abilities.'}, {'date': '2018-01-19', 'text': 'Raid abilities care only that you attacked with a creature. It doesn’t matter how many creatures you attacked with, or which opponent or planeswalker controlled by an opponent those creatures attacked.'}, {'date': '2018-01-19', 'text': 'Raid abilities evaluate the entire turn to see if you attacked with a creature. That creature doesn’t have to still be on the battlefield. Similarly, the player or planeswalker it attacked doesn’t have to still be in the game or on the battlefield, respectively.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Each time a creature dies, check whether Zurgo had dealt any damage to it at any time during that turn. If so, Zurgo’s ability will trigger. It doesn’t matter who controlled the creature or whose graveyard it went to.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'If Zurgo enters the battlefield before the combat phase, it will attack that turn if able. If it enters the battlefield after combat, it won’t attack that turn and will usually be available to block on the following turn.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'If, during your declare attackers step, Zurgo is tapped or is affected by a spell or ability that says it can’t attack, then it doesn’t attack. If there’s a cost associated with having Zurgo attack, you aren’t forced to pay that cost, so it doesn’t have to attack in that case either.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'You still choose which player or planeswalker Zurgo Helmsmasher attacks.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Exiling cards from your graveyard to pay the cost of a spell with delve is a single action. It will cause Rakshasa Vizier’s ability to trigger once, putting a number of +1/+1 counters on it equal to the number of cards you exiled.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'If a card is exiled “instead” of being put into a graveyard, Rakshasa Vizier’s ability won’t trigger.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Face-down creatures and most artifact creatures are colorless.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Ferocious abilities of instants and sorceries that don’t use the word “instead” will provide an additional effect if you control a creature with power 4 or greater as they resolve.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Icy Blast can target a creature that’s already tapped. It still won’t untap during its controller’s next untap step.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Icy Blast tracks the creature, but not its controller. If the creature changes controllers before its first controller’s next untap step has come around, then it won’t untap during its new controller’s next untap step.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Some ferocious abilities that appear on instants and sorceries use the word “instead.” These spells have an upgraded effect if you control a creature with power 4 or greater as they resolve. For these, you only get the upgraded effect, not both effects.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'You check if you control a creature with power 4 or greater as Icy Blast resolves. It doesn’t matter if you control such a creature during any of the relevant untap steps.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Ferocious abilities of instants and sorceries that don’t use the word “instead” will provide an additional effect if you control a creature with power 4 or greater as they resolve.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'If you control a creature with power 4 or greater, Crater’s Claws with X equals 0 will deal 2 damage, with X equals 1 will deal 3 damage, and so on.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Some ferocious abilities that appear on instants and sorceries use the word “instead.” These spells have an upgraded effect if you control a creature with power 4 or greater as they resolve. For these, you only get the upgraded effect, not both effects.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Ferocious abilities of instants and sorceries that don’t use the word “instead” will provide an additional effect if you control a creature with power 4 or greater as they resolve.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'If, during the declare blockers step, a creature is tapped or is affected by a spell or ability that says it can’t block, then it doesn’t block. If there’s a cost associated with having that creature block, its controller isn’t forced to pay that cost. If the player doesn’t, the creature doesn’t block in that case either.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Roar of Challenge doesn’t give any creatures the ability to block the target creature. It just forces those creatures that are already able to block the creature to do so.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Some ferocious abilities that appear on instants and sorceries use the word “instead.” These spells have an upgraded effect if you control a creature with power 4 or greater as they resolve. For these, you only get the upgraded effect, not both effects.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Ferocious abilities of instants and sorceries that don’t use the word “instead” will provide an additional effect if you control a creature with power 4 or greater as they resolve.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Some ferocious abilities that appear on instants and sorceries use the word “instead.” These spells have an upgraded effect if you control a creature with power 4 or greater as they resolve. For these, you only get the upgraded effect, not both effects.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Heir of the Wilds has a triggered ferocious ability with an intervening “if” clause. That ability will check if you control a creature with power 4 or greater whenever Heir of the Wilds attacks. If you don’t at that time, the ability won’t trigger at all. If it triggers, the ability will also check if you control a creature with power 4 or greater as it resolves. If you don’t at that time, the ability won’t do anything. Note that the creature with power 4 or greater you control as the ability triggers doesn’t necessarily have to be the same one you control as the ability resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'If Altar of the Brood enters the battlefield under your control at the same time as other permanents, its ability will trigger for each of those permanents.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'If Rite of the Serpent resolves but the creature isn’t destroyed (perhaps because it has indestructible or it regenerated), you’ll get a Snake token if the creature has a +1/+1 counter on it.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'If the creature is an illegal target as Rite of the Serpent tries to resolve, Rite of the Serpent won’t resolve and none of its effects will occur. You won’t get a Snake token.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Rite of the Serpent won’t create more than one Snake token, even if the target creature had more than one +1/+1 counter on it.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'You get the Snake token no matter who controlled the target creature.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'If Valley Dasher enters the battlefield before the combat phase, it will attack that turn if able. If it enters the battlefield after combat, it won’t attack that turn and will usually be available to block on the following turn.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'If, during your declare attackers step, Valley Dasher is tapped or is affected by a spell or ability that says it can’t attack, then it doesn’t attack. If there’s a cost associated with having Valley Dasher attack, you’re not forced to pay that cost, so it doesn’t have to attack in that case either.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'You still choose which player or planeswalker Valley Dasher attacks.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'If either target is an illegal target when Swift Kick tries to resolve, neither creature will deal or be dealt damage.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'If just the creature you control is an illegal target when Swift Kick tries to resolve, it won’t get +1/+0 until end of turn. If the creature you control is a legal target but the creature you don’t control isn’t, the creature you control will get +1/+0 until end of turn.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'You can’t cast Swift Kick unless you target both a creature you control and a creature you don’t control.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'If some of the creatures are illegal targets as Arc Lightning tries to resolve, the original division of damage still applies but no damage is dealt to the illegal targets. If all targets are illegal, Arc Lightning doesn’t resolve.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'You choose how many targets Arc Lightning has and how the damage is divided as you cast the spell. Each target must receive at least 1 damage.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'If some of the creatures are illegal targets as Incremental Growth tries to resolve, the remaining legal targets still get the appropriate number of +1/+1 counters. If all targets are illegal, Incremental Growth doesn’t resolve.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'You must choose three different targets in order to cast Incremental Growth. You decide how many +1/+1 counters each creature will get as part of casting the spell.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'If the controller of the target spell pays {X}, the spell won’t be countered. Mindswipe will still deal damage to that player.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'If the target spell is an illegal target as Mindswipe tries to resolve (perhaps because it was countered by another spell or ability), Mindswipe won’t resolve and none of its effects will happen. No damage will be dealt.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'If the creature doesn’t die that turn, the delayed triggered ability will simply cease to exist. It won’t trigger on a future turn.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'If the first mode was chosen and either target is an illegal target when Temur Charm tries to resolve, neither creature will deal or be dealt damage.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'If the first mode was chosen and just the creature you control is an illegal target when Temur Charm tries to resolve, it won’t get +1/+1 until end of turn. If the creature you control is a legal target but the creature you don’t control isn’t, the creature you control will get +1/+1 until end of turn.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'If the third mode was chosen, creatures with power 3 or less that enter the battlefield after Temur Charm resolves also can’t block. A creature whose power was 4 or greater when Temur Charm resolved but is 3 or less as the declare blockers step begins also can’t block.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'You can’t cast Temur Charm choosing the first mode unless you target both a creature you control and a creature you don’t control.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'If the permanent or player is an illegal target as Master the Way tries to resolve, Master the Way won’t resolve and none of its effects will happen. You won’t draw a card.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Use the number of cards in your hand after you draw the card to determine how much damage Master the Way deals to the target permanent or player. (Remember that Master the Way is not in your hand; it’s on the stack.)'}]", "[{'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'If the player’s graveyard is empty, the player will shuffle their library, then you’ll draw a card.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'If the target creature can’t block Avalanche Tusker, but could block another attacking creature, it’s free to block that creature or block no creatures at all.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'If, during the declare blockers step, the target creature is tapped or is affected by a spell or ability that says it can’t block, then it doesn’t block. If there’s a cost associated with having that creature block, its controller isn’t forced to pay that cost. If the player doesn’t, the creature doesn’t block in that case either.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'If you choose both modes, they can each target the same creature or they can target different creatures.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Winterflame won’t affect any target that’s illegal as it tries to resolve. If you choose to use both modes and both targets are illegal at that time, Winterflame won’t resolve.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'You choose which mode you’re using—or that you’re using both modes—as you’re casting the spell. Once this choice is made, it can’t be changed later while the spell is on the stack.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'If you control no creatures as Kin-Tree Invocation resolves, you’ll put a 0/0 token onto the battlefield. Unless something else is raising its toughness above 0, it will immediately be put into its owner’s graveyard and then cease to exist. Any abilities that trigger when a creature enters the battlefield or dies will trigger.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'The value of X is determined only once, as Kin-Tree Invocation resolves. The power and toughness of the Spirit Warrior token doesn’t later change if the greatest toughness among creatures you control changes.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'If you’re using Dragon Grip’s ferocious ability to cast it as though it had flash, you must control a creature with power 4 or greater only as you begin the casting process and put Dragon Grip on the stack. Losing control of that creature while casting Dragon Grip (perhaps because you sacrificed it to activate a mana ability), or in response to Dragon Grip won’t affect Dragon Grip on the stack.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'You must cast Dragon Grip at the latest during the declare blockers step after blockers are declared if you want first strike to matter during that combat.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'In some rare cases, the blocking creature wasn’t declared as a blocking creature that combat (for example, if it entered the battlefield blocking). In that case, the attacking creatures it was blocking won’t gain trample even though the blocking creature is destroyed.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'The attacking creatures that the destroyed creature was blocking remain blocked (even if no other creatures were blocking them). An attacking creature with trample that has no creature blocking it can deal its combat damage to the defending player or planeswalker.'}, {'date': '2016-07-13', 'text': 'The attacking creatures that the destroyed creature was blocking remain blocked (even if no other creatures were blocking them). An attacking creature with trample that has no creature blocking it will deal its combat damage to the defending player or planeswalker.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Kheru Bloodsucker’s triggered ability will trigger when it dies if its toughness is 4 or greater.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Lens of Clarity doesn’t let you look at face-down spells you don’t control on the stack.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Lens of Clarity doesn’t stop your opponents from looking at face-down creatures they control.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Lens of Clarity lets you look at the top card of your library and at face-down creatures you don’t control whenever you want, even if you don’t have priority. This action doesn’t use the stack. Knowing what those cards are becomes part of the information you have access to, just like you can look at the cards in your hand.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Mardu Warshrieker’s raid ability isn’t a mana ability even though it adds mana to your mana pool. It uses the stack and can be responded to.'}, {'date': '2018-01-19', 'text': 'Raid abilities care only that you attacked with a creature. It doesn’t matter how many creatures you attacked with, or which opponent or planeswalker controlled by an opponent those creatures attacked.'}, {'date': '2018-01-19', 'text': 'Raid abilities evaluate the entire turn to see if you attacked with a creature. That creature doesn’t have to still be on the battlefield. Similarly, the player or planeswalker it attacked doesn’t have to still be in the game or on the battlefield, respectively.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Once a creature legally blocks War-Name Aspirant, changing that creature’s power to 1 or less won’t change or undo that block.'}, {'date': '2018-01-19', 'text': 'Raid abilities care only that you attacked with a creature. It doesn’t matter how many creatures you attacked with, or which opponent or planeswalker controlled by an opponent those creatures attacked.'}, {'date': '2018-01-19', 'text': 'Raid abilities evaluate the entire turn to see if you attacked with a creature. That creature doesn’t have to still be on the battlefield. Similarly, the player or planeswalker it attacked doesn’t have to still be in the game or on the battlefield, respectively.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Once you announce that you are activating the ability of Retribution of the Ancients, no player may take any actions before you pay its costs. Notably, opponents can’t try to remove a creature with counters on it to stop you from paying.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Only creatures on the battlefield when Death Frenzy resolves will get -2/-2. However, if a creature enters the battlefield and then dies later that turn, you’ll gain 1 life for it.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'You gain 1 life for each creature that Death Frenzy causes to have a toughness of 0 or less. The delayed triggered ability is created before state-based actions cause any creatures with 0 or less toughness to die.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Only creatures you control as Flying Crane Technique resolves will gain flying and double strike. Creatures that come under your control later in the turn will not.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Only creatures you control as the first ability resolves will get the bonuses. Creatures you come to control after that happens will not.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'When the emblem’s ability resolves, if the player controls no creatures, the player won’t sacrifice anything.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Permanents attached to creatures may include Auras and Equipment. All the affected permanents are destroyed at the same time.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': \'Several creatures with outlast also grant an ability to creatures you control with +1/+1 counters on them, including themselves. These counters could come from an outlast ability, but any +1/+1 counter on the creature will count.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': "The cost to activate a creature\'s outlast ability includes the tap symbol ({T}). A creature\'s outlast ability can\'t be activated unless that creature has been under your control continuously since the beginning of your turn."}]', "[{'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Several creatures with outlast also grant an ability to creatures you control with +1/+1 counters on them, including themselves. These counters could come from an outlast ability, but any +1/+1 counter on the creature will count.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'The Warrior token is created before the +1/+1 counter is put on Herald of Anafenza.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'The cost to activate a creature’s outlast ability includes the tap symbol ({T}). A creature’s outlast ability can’t be activated unless that creature has been under your control continuously since the beginning of your turn.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Several creatures with outlast also grant an ability to creatures you control with +1/+1 counters on them, including themselves. These counters could come from an outlast ability, but any +1/+1 counter on the creature will count.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'The cost to activate a creature’s outlast ability includes the tap symbol ({T}). A creature’s outlast ability can’t be activated unless that creature has been under your control continuously since the beginning of your turn.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Singing Bell Strike can be cast targeting any creature, including one that’s already tapped.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'The activated ability that untaps the creature is granted to the enchanted creature. Only the creature’s controller can activate this ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Smoke Teller’s ability lets you look at the creature as the ability resolves. It doesn’t let you look at it later, although you should be given a reasonable amount of time to look at it. In a multiplayer game, be sure not to reveal the card to other players.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'You could target a creature you control with Smoke Teller’s ability, but there’s no benefit to doing so. Remember, you may look at face-down spells you control on the stack and face-down permanents you control at any time.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'The ability can target a creature that’s already tapped. It still won’t untap during its controller’s next untap step.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'The ability tracks the creature, but not its controller. If the creature changes controllers before its first controller’s next untap step has come around, then it won’t untap during its new controller’s next untap step.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'You decide whether to pay {1} as the triggered ability resolves.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': \'The activated ability can be activated only if Bloodsoaked Champion is in your graveyard. Notably, if it attacks and then dies later in the turn, you can use its ability to return it to the battlefield, as its attack satisfies its own activation instruction.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-01-19\', \'text\': "Raid abilities care only that you attacked with a creature. It doesn\'t matter how many creatures you attacked with, or which opponent or planeswalker controlled by an opponent those creatures attacked."}, {\'date\': \'2018-01-19\', \'text\': "Raid abilities evaluate the entire turn to see if you attacked with a creature. That creature doesn\'t have to still be on the battlefield. Similarly, the player or planeswalker it attacked doesn\'t have to still be in the game or on the battlefield, respectively."}]', "[{'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'The enters-the-battlefield ability can target Armament Corps itself.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'You choose how the counters will be distributed as you put the ability on the stack. Notably, if you choose to put one +1/+1 counter on each of two target creatures, and one of those creatures becomes an illegal target in response, the +1/+1 counter that would’ve gone on that creature is lost. It can’t be put on the remaining legal target.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'The last ability is cumulative. If you control an additional Brave the Sands, your creatures will each be able to block three creatures, and so on.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'The regeneration ability is granted to the enchanted creature. Only the creature’s controller can activate the regeneration ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'The value of X is determined as the activated ability resolves. If the equipped creature isn’t on the battlefield at that time, use its power the last time it was on the battlefield to determine the value of X.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'If the equipped creature’s power is negative while resolving the activated ability it gains, X is considered to be 0. (This is a change from previous rulings.)'}]", "[{'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Use the toughness of the creature as it last existed on the battlefield to determine how much life you gain.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Warrior creatures you control as Rush of Battle resolves gain lifelink in addition to getting +2/+1.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'You choose the color as Feat of Resistance resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'You choose which ability Butcher of the Horde gains when the activated ability resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'You decide whether to pay 1 life as the triggered ability resolves. You may do this only once per ability (in other words, once per Warrior that deals combat damage to a player).'}]", "[{'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'You don’t have to target a creature to cast Trap Essence, although you must target a creature spell on the stack.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'You make the decision whether to pay {1} as the ability resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-03-14', 'text': 'Crippling Chill can target a creature that’s already tapped. It still won’t untap during its controller’s next untap step.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'If Sultai Flayer dies, and its toughness is still 4 or greater, its own ability will trigger.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-01-19', 'text': 'Raid abilities care only that you attacked with a creature. It doesn’t matter how many creatures you attacked with, or which opponent or planeswalker controlled by an opponent those creatures attacked.'}, {'date': '2018-01-19', 'text': 'Raid abilities evaluate the entire turn to see if you attacked with a creature. That creature doesn’t have to still be on the battlefield. Similarly, the player or planeswalker it attacked doesn’t have to still be in the game or on the battlefield, respectively.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'You must discard exactly one card to cast Tormenting Voice; you can’t cast it without discarding a card, and you can’t discard additional cards.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2019-07-12\', \'text\': "Act of Treason can target any creature, even one that\'s untapped or one you already control."}, {\'date\': \'2019-07-12\', \'text\': "Gaining control of a creature doesn\'t cause you to gain control of any Auras or Equipment attached to it."}]', "[{'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'Heart-Piercer Bow (not the equipped creature) is the source of the triggered ability and the source of the damage. This means that a creature with protection from green may be targeted even if Heart-Piercer Bow is equipped to a green creature, but a creature with protection from artifacts may not.'}, {'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'If a creature is attacking a planeswalker, the controller of that planeswalker is the defending player.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If the target creature is an illegal target by the time Defiant Strike tries to resolve, the spell won\'t resolve. You won\'t draw a card."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-02-05\', \'text\': "If a spell has {X} in its mana cost, use the value chosen for X when determining the spell\'s mana value."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "A face-down spell has mana value 0 and can\'t be targeted by Disdainful Stroke."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "Because delve isn\'t an alternative cost, it can be used in conjunction with alternative costs, such as flashback. It can also be used to pay for additional costs that include generic mana."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "Delve doesn\'t change a spell\'s mana cost or mana value. For example, Treasure Cruise\'s mana value is 8 even if you exiled three cards to cast it."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "You can exile cards to pay only for generic mana, and you can\'t exile more cards than the generic mana requirement of a spell with delve. For example, you can\'t exile more than seven cards from your graveyard to cast Treasure Cruise unless an effect has increased its cost."}]', "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Because delve isn’t an alternative cost, it can be used in conjunction with alternative costs, such as flashback. It can also be used to pay for additional costs that include generic mana.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Delve doesn’t change a spell’s mana cost or mana value. For example, Treasure Cruise’s mana value is 8 even if you exiled three cards to cast it.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'You can exile cards to pay only for generic mana, and you can’t exile more cards than the generic mana requirement of a spell with delve. For example, you can’t exile more than seven cards from your graveyard to cast Treasure Cruise unless an effect has increased its cost.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If Temur Ascendancy leaves the battlefield, creatures you control lose haste. If they haven’t been under your control since the turn began and don’t otherwise have haste, they can’t attack this turn. If they’ve already attacked, they remain attacking creatures.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If a creature is entering the battlefield under your control, consider static abilities to determine whether its power is 4 or greater. Spells, activated abilities, and triggered abilities can’t be used to raise the creature’s power in time to have Temur Ascendancy’s last ability trigger or to lower it in time to stop it from triggering.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Once the last ability of Temur Ascendancy has triggered, lowering the power of the creature won’t stop you from drawing a card.'}]", "[{'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'Each additional Hardened Scales you control will increase the number of +1/+1 counters placed on a creature you control by one.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'If a creature you control would enter the battlefield with a number of +1/+1 counters on it, it enters with that many plus one instead.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'If two or more effects attempt to modify how many counters would be put on a creature you control, you choose the order to apply those effects, no matter who controls the sources of those effects.'}]", "[{'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'Any cards you don’t cast this way will remain in exile.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'If a spell you cast has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'If you cast a spell “without paying its mana cost,” you can’t choose to cast it for any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs, such as kicker costs. If the spell has any mandatory additional costs, those must be paid to cast the spell.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'You cast the spells one at a time as Villainous Wealth is resolving, choosing modes, targets, and so on. The last spell you cast will be the first one to resolve. Ignore timing restrictions based on the spells’ types. Other timing restrictions, such as “Cast [this spell] only during combat,” must be followed.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'You choose which spells (if any) to cast as Villainous Wealth resolves. If you do, you do so as part of the resolution of Villainous Wealth. You can’t wait to cast them later in the turn.'}]"]
foreign_names: ['[{\'name\': \'Abbrechen\', \'text\': \'Neutralisiere einen Zauberspruch deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Selbst das gewaltigste Inferno beginnt als Funke. Und jeder kann einen Funken auslöschen." —Chanyi, Nebelfeuerweiser\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=387309&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'055e3c35-157d-4224-8ef3-538390005238\', \'multiverseId\': 387309}, \'multiverseid\': 387309}, {\'name\': \'Deshacer\', \'text\': \'Contrarresta el hechizo objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Incluso el mayor de los infiernos comienza con una chispa... y cualquiera puede sofocar una chispa". —Chanyi, sabio nieblardiente\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=389192&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'924e148c-7264-4733-95c5-6550f4b38760\', \'multiverseId\': 389192}, \'multiverseid\': 389192}, {\'name\': \'Révocation\', \'text\': \'Contrecarrez le sort ciblé.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Même le plus ardent des brasiers débute par une étincelle que quiconque peut éteindre. » —Chanyi, mage brumefeu\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=387578&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b5bd8f5e-31f4-41be-a8c7-80f276855bae\', \'multiverseId\': 387578}, \'multiverseid\': 387578}, {\'name\': \'Eliminare\', \'text\': \'Neutralizza una magia bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Persino il più grande incendio ha origine da una scintilla che chiunque può soffocare." —Chanyi, saggio della pirobruma\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=387847&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'23af597e-6235-496b-ae9c-05ef3cf50a59\', \'multiverseId\': 387847}, \'multiverseid\': 387847}, {\'name\': \'取り消し\', \'text\': \'呪文１つを対象とし、それを打ち消す。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「巨大な猛火ですらはじまりは火花に過ぎない。そして誰でも火花を消すことはできる。」 ――霧炎の賢者、チャンイ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=388116&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'784bf10c-b2eb-4df9-8759-9d60b079dc59\', \'multiverseId\': 388116}, \'multiverseid\': 388116}, {\'name\': \'주문 취소\', \'text\': \'주문을 목표로 정한다. 그 주문을 무효화한다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"가장 뜨거운 불바다라고 해도 그 시작은 자그마한 불똥에 불과한 법. 불똥은 누구나 소멸시킬 수 있지." —안개불꽃 현자 찬이\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=388385&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3ae0dc6c-ccb2-4588-be97-53360079182a\', \'multiverseId\': 388385}, \'multiverseid\': 388385}, {\'name\': \'Cancelar\', \'text\': \'Anule a mágica alvo.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Até o maior dos incêndios começa com uma centelha. E qualquer pessoa pode criar uma centelha." — Chanyi, sábio névoa-ígnea\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=388654&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f050b3f-138b-45b1-a7ae-3e71ebbabd34\', \'multiverseId\': 388654}, \'multiverseid\': 388654}, {\'name\': \'Отмена\', \'text\': \'Отмените целевое заклинание.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Даже самый страшный пожар начинается с одной искры. А искру может затушить кто угодно». — Чань-И, мудрец огненного тумана\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=388923&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6cb9fc0e-865e-490e-b143-c6ccf7301e13\', \'multiverseId\': 388923}, \'multiverseid\': 388923}, {\'name\': \'取消\', \'text\': \'反击目标咒语。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「燎原业火，亦星火生之，然星火人人均可熄之。」 ～雾火智者禅益\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=386771&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0dc2560a-94c5-4362-a489-2c9e9ce64388\', \'multiverseId\': 386771}, \'multiverseid\': 386771}, {\'name\': \'取消\', \'text\': \'反擊目標咒語。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「燎原業火，亦星火生之，然星火人人均可熄之。」 ～霧火智者禪益\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=387040&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6bd4eac5-8410-49b7-aa31-b84f0261b091\', \'multiverseId\': 387040}, \'multiverseid\': 387040}]', '[{\'name\': \'Abwehrende Hand\', \'text\': \'Das nächste Mal, dass dir eine Quelle, die du bestimmst, in diesem Zug Schaden zufügen würde, verhindere diesen Schaden. Falls auf diese Weise Schaden verhindert wurde, fügt die Abwehrende Hand dem Beherrscher der Quelle entsprechend viele Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=387323&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a8f47803-270b-46d5-a34a-6de8c9c0145e\', \'multiverseId\': 387323}, \'multiverseid\': 387323}, {\'name\': \'Palma bloqueadora\', \'text\': \'La próxima vez que una fuente de tu elección fuera a hacerte daño este turno, prevén ese daño. Si se previene daño de esta manera, la Palma bloqueadora hace esa misma cantidad de daño al controlador de esa fuente.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=389206&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'532bda0f-ebbc-4ee7-a4ef-da4beb9156de\', \'multiverseId\': 389206}, \'multiverseid\': 389206}, {\'name\': \'Paume déflectrice\', \'text\': "La prochaine fois qu\'une source de votre choix devrait vous infliger des blessures ce tour-ci, prévenez ces blessures. Si des blessures sont prévenues de cette manière, la Paume déflectrice inflige autant de blessures au contrôleur de cette source.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=387592&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f5604151-d3de-490d-bffc-645f034f76ad\', \'multiverseId\': 387592}, \'multiverseid\': 387592}, {\'name\': \'Palmo della Deviazione\', \'text\': \'La prossima volta che una fonte a tua scelta ti sta per infliggere danno in questo turno, previeni quel danno. Se viene prevenuto danno in questo modo, il Palmo della Deviazione infligge altrettanti danni al controllore di quella fonte.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=387861&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'416a3343-4994-4052-8815-74e5cb36f4b3\', \'multiverseId\': 387861}, \'multiverseid\': 387861}, {\'name\': \'跳ね返す掌\', \'text\': \'このターン、あなたが選んだ発生源１つが次にあなたに与えるダメージを軽減する。これによりダメージが軽減されたなら、跳ね返す掌はその発生源のコントローラーに同じ点数のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=388130&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'889060e9-852b-4c02-923a-62d2e26354ba\', \'multiverseId\': 388130}, \'multiverseid\': 388130}, {\'name\': \'반격장\', \'text\': \'이 턴에 당신이 선택한 원천이 당신에게 입힐 다음 피해를 방지한다. 피해를 이렇게 방지하면, 반격장은 그 원천의 조종자에게 방지된 만큼의 피해를 입힌다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=388399&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9c10db4b-ea7a-40cd-b90b-61bcfaf13bfd\', \'multiverseId\': 388399}, \'multiverseid\': 388399}, {\'name\': \'Palma Defletora\', \'text\': \'Na próxima vez que uma fonte de sua escolha for lhe causar dano neste turno, previna aquele dano. Se o dano for prevenido desta maneira, Palma Defletora causará uma quantidade equivalente de dano ao controlador daquela fonte.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=388668&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc7f3e4a-faf4-4b09-949a-fe486cddf860\', \'multiverseId\': 388668}, \'multiverseid\': 388668}, {\'name\': \'Отражающая Ладонь\', \'text\': \'В следующий раз, когда выбранный вами источник должен будет нанести вам повреждения в этом ходу, предотвратите те повреждения. Если повреждения предотвращаются таким образом, Отражающая Ладонь наносит столько же повреждений игроку, контролирующему тот источник.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=388937&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d6a1e1d-4a80-4543-b9b3-bc4ddfec2bf4\', \'multiverseId\': 388937}, \'multiverseid\': 388937}, {\'name\': \'馈击掌\', \'text\': \'选择一个来源。于本回合中，防止该来源下一次将对你造成的伤害。如果以此法防止伤害，则馈击掌对该来源的操控者造成等量的伤害。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=386785&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e4c4bb40-bccd-4806-a658-a6d7b54509fa\', \'multiverseId\': 386785}, \'multiverseid\': 386785}, {\'name\': \'饋擊掌\', \'text\': \'選擇一個來源。於本回合中，防止該來源下一次將對你造成的傷害。如果以此法防止傷害，則饋擊掌對該來源的操控者造成等量的傷害。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=387054&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9cde5b0d-35a4-4e70-b5da-234ff698f828\', \'multiverseId\': 387054}, \'multiverseid\': 387054}]', '[{\'name\': \'Abzan-Amulett\', \'text\': \'Bestimme eines —\\n• Schicke eine Kreatur deiner Wahl mit Stärke 3 oder mehr ins Exil.\\n• Du ziehst zwei Karten und verlierst 2 Lebenspunkte.\\n• Verteile zwei +1/+1-Marken auf eine oder zwei Kreaturen deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=387274&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2b06004a-91e3-4cb5-ab51-34c455784b40\', \'multiverseId\': 387274}, \'multiverseid\': 387274}, {\'name\': \'Sortilegio abzano\', \'text\': \'Elige uno:\\n• Exilia la criatura objetivo con fuerza de 3 o más.\\n• Robas dos cartas y pierdes 2 vidas.\\n• Distribuye dos contadores +1/+1 entre una o dos criaturas objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=389157&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3883d070-1816-4e03-a071-a1735766a63a\', \'multiverseId\': 389157}, \'multiverseid\': 389157}, {\'name\': "Charme d\'Abzan", \'text\': "Choisissez l\'un —\\n• Exilez une créature ciblée avec une force supérieure ou égale à 3.\\n• Vous piochez deux cartes et vous perdez 2 points de vie.\\n• Répartissez deux marqueurs +1/+1 entre une ou deux créatures ciblées.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=387543&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1b360c4c-0f96-4e00-a070-c0aa4c4550d0\', \'multiverseId\': 387543}, \'multiverseid\': 387543}, {\'name\': \'Talismano Abzan\', \'text\': \'Scegli uno —\\n• Esilia una creatura bersaglio con forza pari o superiore a 3.\\n• Pesca due carte e perdi 2 punti vita.\\n• Distribuisci due segnalini +1/+1 tra una o due creature bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=387812&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'49bc0224-9f3f-4824-8f9c-d96164d8bf20\', \'multiverseId\': 387812}, \'multiverseid\': 387812}, {\'name\': \'アブザンの魔除け\', \'text\': \'以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n・パワーが３以上のクリーチャー１体を対象とし、それを追放する。\\n・あなたはカードを２枚引き、あなたは２点のライフを失う。\\n・クリーチャーを１体か２体対象とする。それらに２個の＋１/＋１カウンターを好きなように割り振って置く。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=388081&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce3b210c-c1ce-4818-b50f-5abfc715c35e\', \'multiverseId\': 388081}, \'multiverseid\': 388081}, {\'name\': \'아브잔 부적\', \'text\': \'하나를 선택한다 —\\n• 공격력이 3 이상인 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물을 추방한다.\\n• 당신은 카드 두 장을 뽑고 생명 2점을 잃는다.\\n• 생물 한 개 또는 두 개를 목표로 정한다. 그 생물들에 +1/+1 카운터 두 개를 배분한다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=388350&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'12b702bc-7bbb-4485-ba62-f77d6034cee3\', \'multiverseId\': 388350}, \'multiverseid\': 388350}, {\'name\': \'Amuleto Abzan\', \'text\': \'Escolha um —\\n• Exile a criatura alvo com poder igual ou superior a 3.\\n• Você compra dois cards e perde 2 pontos de vida.\\n• Distribua dois marcadores +1/+1 entre uma ou duas criaturas alvo.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=388619&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'880e897b-96fc-4593-8ad9-451398eadc02\', \'multiverseId\': 388619}, \'multiverseid\': 388619}, {\'name\': \'Талисман Абзана\', \'text\': \'Выберите одно —\\n• Изгоните целевое существо с силой не менее 3.\\n• Вы берете две карты и теряете 2 жизни.\\n• Распределите два жетона +1/+1 между одним или двумя целевыми существами.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=388888&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'39152cdf-4466-4c26-b11a-de97dc4928d3\', \'multiverseId\': 388888}, \'multiverseid\': 388888}, {\'name\': \'阿布赞护符\', \'text\': \'选择一项～\\n•放逐目标力量等于或大于3的生物。\\n•你抓两张牌且你失去2点生命。\\n•将两个+1/+1指示物分配给一个或两个目标生物。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=386736&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0d6299e2-7449-4510-b7c5-46b99b5802da\', \'multiverseId\': 386736}, \'multiverseid\': 386736}, {\'name\': \'阿布贊護符\', \'text\': \'選擇一項～\\n•放逐目標力量等於或大於3的生物。\\n•你抽兩張牌且你失去2點生命。\\n•將兩個+1/+1指示物分配給一個或兩個目標生物。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=387005&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c3a51540-8d64-439f-a88f-00da04cf43b2\', \'multiverseId\': 387005}, \'multiverseid\': 387005}]', '[{\'name\': \'Abzan-Falkner\', \'text\': \'Standhaft {W} ({W}, {T}: Lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf diese Kreatur. Spiele Standhaft wie eine Hexerei.)\\nJede Kreatur, die du kontrollierst und auf der mindestens eine +1/+1-Marke liegt, hat Flugfähigkeit.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'Der schnellste Weg durch die Dünen führt darüber.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=387275&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'17fef968-83ed-4e5f-9e16-1de5474c6ed8\', \'multiverseId\': 387275}, \'multiverseid\': 387275}, {\'name\': \'Halconero abzano\', \'text\': \'Supervivencia {W}. ({W}, {T}: Pon un contador +1/+1 sobre esta criatura. Activa la habilidad de supervivencia solo como un conjuro.)\\nCada criatura que controlas con un contador +1/+1 sobre ella tiene la habilidad de volar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado humano\', \'flavor\': \'El camino más rápido para cruzar las dunas es por encima.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=389158&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6be15da4-cce8-4788-bce1-4de4bc83f839\', \'multiverseId\': 389158}, \'multiverseid\': 389158}, {\'name\': \'Fauconnier abzan\', \'text\': "Résilience {W} ({W}, {T} : Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur cette créature. N\'utilisez la résilience que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.)\\nChaque créature que vous contrôlez avec un marqueur +1/+1 sur elle a le vol.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et soldat\', \'flavor\': \'Le moyen le plus rapide de traverser les dunes reste encore de les survoler.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=387544&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b8349cd1-cde2-45b6-90db-30eac63310ac\', \'multiverseId\': 387544}, \'multiverseid\': 387544}, {\'name\': \'Falconiere Abzan\', \'text\': \'Perdurare {W} ({W}, {T}: Metti un segnalino +1/+1 su questa creatura. Perdura solo quando potresti lanciare una stregoneria.)\\nOgni creatura con un segnalino +1/+1 che controlli ha volare.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Umano\', \'flavor\': \'La via più breve attraverso le dune è il cielo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=387813&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'258dd1cc-d1e5-4b72-b43b-594827883b8c\', \'multiverseId\': 387813}, \'multiverseid\': 387813}, {\'name\': \'アブザンの鷹匠\', \'text\': \'長久{W}（{W}, {T}：このクリーチャーの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。長久はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。）\\nあなたがコントロールする＋１/＋１カウンターが置かれている各クリーチャーは飛行を持つ。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・兵士\', \'flavor\': \'砂丘群を越えるのに最も速い手段は、上から行くことだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=388082&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6ddf5239-2197-4eac-9c85-698bb1840d23\', \'multiverseId\': 388082}, \'multiverseid\': 388082}, {\'name\': \'아브잔 매 조련사\', \'text\': \'버티기 {W} ({W}, {T}: 이 생물에 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 올려놓는다. 당신은 집중마법을 발동할 수 있는 시기에만 버티기를 활성화할 수 있다.)\\n당신이 조종하는 생물 중 +1/+1 카운터를 가진 각 생물은 비행을 가진다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 병사\', \'flavor\': \'모래 언덕은 위로 넘어가는 것이 가장 빠르다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=388351&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'91f045a8-5fa1-42e0-b0c9-46d79af48af3\', \'multiverseId\': 388351}, \'multiverseid\': 388351}, {\'name\': \'Falcoeiro Abzan\', \'text\': \'Sobreviver {W} ({W}, {T}: Coloque um marcador +1/+1 nesta criatura. Use sobreviver somente como um feitiço.)\\nCada criatura que você controla com um marcador +1/+1 tem voar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Soldado\', \'flavor\': \'O modo mais rápido de cruzar as dunas é por cima.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=388620&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'45301755-dbdf-4484-ab44-28a1d9aae277\', \'multiverseId\': 388620}, \'multiverseid\': 388620}, {\'name\': \'Абзанский Сокольничий\', \'text\': \'Стойкость {W} ({W}, {T}: положите один жетон +1/+1 на это существо. Используйте Стойкость только как волшебство.)\\nКаждое существо под вашим контролем, на котором есть жетон +1/+1, имеет Полет.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Солдат\', \'flavor\': \'Самый быстрый путь через дюны — над ними.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=388889&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cfae5066-8643-4ed8-8ce2-db28b70c5358\', \'multiverseId\': 388889}, \'multiverseid\': 388889}, {\'name\': \'阿布赞训隼兵\', \'text\': \'延生{W}（{W}，{T}：在此生物上放置一个+1/+1指示物。延生的时机视同法术。）\\n每个由你操控且其上有+1/+1指示物的生物均具有飞行异能。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'横跨沙丘的捷径在空中。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=386737&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a1458769-45ee-4953-a6cd-2d5726dbdaaf\', \'multiverseId\': 386737}, \'multiverseid\': 386737}, {\'name\': \'阿布贊訓隼兵\', \'text\': \'延生{W}（{W}，{T}：在此生物上放置一個+1/+1指示物。延生的時機視同巫術。）\\n每個由你操控且其上有+1/+1指示物的生物均具有飛行異能。\', \'type\': \'生物～人類／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'橫跨沙丘的捷徑在空中。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=387006&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c9496e8-acc2-4883-820e-20474fd4c5b0\', \'multiverseId\': 387006}, \'multiverseid\': 387006}]', '[{\'name\': \'Abzan-Führerin\', \'text\': \'Lebensverknüpfung (Schaden, der von dieser Kreatur zugefügt wird, lässt dich ebenso viele Lebenspunkte dazuerhalten.)\\nMorph {2}{W}{B}{G} (Du kannst diese Karte verdeckt für {3} als eine 2/2 Kreatur wirken. Decke sie zu einem beliebigen Zeitpunkt für ihre Morph-Kosten auf.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Straßen hier sind wüst und wechselhaft. Folge mir oder stirb in der Ödnis."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=387276&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c7a7b360-f1fb-40bc-ad05-2fa4d6119734\', \'multiverseId\': 387276}, \'multiverseid\': 387276}, {\'name\': \'Guía abzana\', \'text\': \'Vínculo vital. (El daño hecho por esta criatura también hace que ganes esa misma cantidad de vidas.)\\nMetamorfosis {2}{W}{B}{G}. (Puedes lanzar esta carta boca abajo como una criatura 2/2 pagando {3}. Ponla boca arriba en cualquier momento pagando su coste de metamorfosis.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Estos caminos son inhóspitos y cambiantes. Síganme o mueran en los yermos".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=389159&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f86b1420-2aed-4e0e-8335-fc71110bcdd6\', \'multiverseId\': 389159}, \'multiverseid\': 389159}, {\'name\': \'Guide abzane\', \'text\': \'Lien de vie (Les blessures infligées par cette créature vous font aussi gagner autant de points de vie.)\\nMue {2}{W}{B}{G} (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte face cachée comme une créature 2/2 pour {3}. Retournez-la à tout moment pour son coût de mue.)\', \'type\': \'Créature : humain et guerrier\', \'flavor\': \'« Ces routes sont changeantes et désolées. Suivez-moi, ou vous mourrez dans les landes. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=387545&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'51a9dd4e-bf4e-4cac-95f2-01fc4c8d7e42\', \'multiverseId\': 387545}, \'multiverseid\': 387545}, {\'name\': \'Guida Abzan\', \'text\': \'Legame vitale (Il danno inflitto da questa creatura ti fa anche guadagnare altrettanti punti vita.)\\nMetamorfosi {2}{W}{B}{G} (Puoi lanciare questa carta a faccia in giù come una creatura 2/2 pagando {3}. Girala a faccia in su in qualsiasi momento pagando il suo costo di metamorfosi.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Queste strade sono desolate e mutevoli. Seguitemi, o morirete in queste distese."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=387814&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a41342c7-cba8-44cf-a04c-5ffcebb0e442\', \'multiverseId\': 387814}, \'multiverseid\': 387814}, {\'name\': \'アブザンの先達\', \'text\': \'絆魂（このクリーチャーがダメージを与えると、さらにあなたはその点数分のライフを得る。）\\n変異{2}{W}{B}{G}（あなたはこのカードを、{3}で２/２クリーチャーとして裏向きに唱えてもよい。これの変異コストで、これをいつでも表向きにしてよい。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'「これらの道は荒廃しているうえに変わりやすい。私の後をついてくるがいい。さもなくば荒野で屍をさらすことになる。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=388083&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c61c63fc-14a1-4996-86b9-9d316de1aa6e\', \'multiverseId\': 388083}, \'multiverseid\': 388083}, {\'name\': \'아브잔 길잡이\', \'text\': \'생명연결 (이 생물이 피해를 입히면, 당신은 그 피해만큼의 생명점을 얻는다.)\\n변이 {2}{W}{B}{G} (당신은 {3}을 지불해서 이 카드를 뒷면 상태의 2/2 생물로 발동할 수 있다. 언제든지 변이 비용을 지불하고 앞면이 보이도록 뒤집을 수 있다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 전사\', \'flavor\': \'"이 길들은 삭막하고 변덕이 심하지. 날 따라오지 않으면 황무지에서 죽게 될 것이다."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=388352&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'41d54397-a4c7-49ea-a778-1d2f49facbb7\', \'multiverseId\': 388352}, \'multiverseid\': 388352}, {\'name\': \'Guia Azban\', \'text\': \'Vínculo com a vida (O dano causado por esta criatura faz com que você ganhe uma quantidade equivalente de pontos de vida.)\\nMetamorfose {2}{W}{B}{G} (Você pode conjurar este card com a face voltada para baixo como uma criatura 2/2 por {3}. Volte sua face para cima a qualquer momento pagando seu custo de metamorfose.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Essas estradas são desoladas e mutáveis. Siga-me ou morra no deserto."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=388621&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'66de6eb2-fea1-4df3-ba6d-2c6276e31dd1\', \'multiverseId\': 388621}, \'multiverseid\': 388621}, {\'name\': \'Абзанская Проводница\', \'text\': \'Цепь жизни (Повреждения, наносимые этим существом, также заставляют вас получить такое же количество жизней.)\\nОборотень {2}{W}{B}{G} (Вы можете разыграть эту карту рубашкой вверх как существо 2/2 за {3}. Переверните ее рубашкой вниз в любой момент за ее стоимость Оборотня.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Воин\', \'flavor\': \'«Эти дороги заброшены и непостоянны. Ступай за мной, или погибнешь в пустошах».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=388890&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a45468a6-67ef-4b02-a1f6-9e2f3f2bbfc9\', \'multiverseId\': 388890}, \'multiverseid\': 388890}, {\'name\': \'阿布赞向导\', \'text\': \'系命（此生物所造成的伤害会让你获得等量的生命。）\\n变身{2}{W}{B}{G}（你可牌面朝下地施放此牌并支付{3}，将其当成2/2生物。可随时支付其变身费用使其翻回正面。）\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／战士\', \'flavor\': \'「这些路途荒凉而多变。跟着我，否则你就会命丧荒野。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=386738&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eafaf82d-8845-47a1-b35e-f92f1715310e\', \'multiverseId\': 386738}, \'multiverseid\': 386738}, {\'name\': \'阿布贊嚮導\', \'text\': \'繫命（此生物所造成的傷害會讓你獲得等量的生命。）\\n變身{2}{W}{B}{G}（你可牌面朝下地施放此牌並支付{3}，將其當成2/2生物。可隨時支付其變身費用使其翻回正面。）\', \'type\': \'生物～人類／戰士\', \'flavor\': \'「這些路途荒涼而多變。跟著我，否則你就會命喪荒野。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=387007&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2937f40a-d45f-46f6-86f9-b8a860d3b16f\', \'multiverseId\': 387007}, \'multiverseid\': 387007}]', '[{\'name\': \'Abzan-Kampfpriester\', \'text\': \'Standhaft {W} ({W}, {T}: Lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf diese Kreatur. Spiele Standhaft wie eine Hexerei.)\\nJede Kreatur, die du kontrollierst und auf der mindestens eine +1/+1-Marke liegt, hat Lebensverknüpfung.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Kleriker\', \'flavor\': \'„Wohin ich auch gehe, unsere Ahnen gehen mit mir."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=387273&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'720e0216-a886-4df5-a464-c6036fd523d4\', \'multiverseId\': 387273}, \'multiverseid\': 387273}, {\'name\': \'Sacerdote guerrero abzano\', \'text\': \'Supervivencia {W}. ({W}, {T}: Pon un contador +1/+1 sobre esta criatura. Activa la habilidad de supervivencia solo como un conjuro.)\\nCada criatura que controlas con un contador +1/+1 sobre ella tiene la habilidad de vínculo vital.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Clérigo humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Allá por donde camino, caminan también los ancestros".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=389156&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'785d8caf-217e-4c3e-809d-169890908202\', \'multiverseId\': 389156}, \'multiverseid\': 389156}, {\'name\': \'Prêtre de bataille abzan\', \'text\': "Résilience {W} ({W}, {T} : Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur cette créature. N\'utilisez la résilience que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.)\\nChaque créature que vous contrôlez avec un marqueur +1/+1 sur elle a le lien de vie.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et clerc\', \'flavor\': "« Où que j\'aille, mes ancêtres m\'accompagnent. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=387542&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'35daa0de-5d90-4fc3-8255-5e20f421dcdf\', \'multiverseId\': 387542}, \'multiverseid\': 387542}, {\'name\': \'Sacerdote Guerriero Abzan\', \'text\': \'Perdurare {W} ({W}, {T}: Metti un segnalino +1/+1 su questa creatura. Perdura solo quando potresti lanciare una stregoneria.)\\nOgni creatura con un segnalino +1/+1 che controlli ha legame vitale.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Chierico Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Ovunque io vada, gli antenati sono con me."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=387811&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0ba5cac6-c5b3-4748-882c-318e1d983b6d\', \'multiverseId\': 387811}, \'multiverseid\': 387811}, {\'name\': \'アブザンの戦僧侶\', \'text\': \'長久{W}（{W}, {T}：このクリーチャーの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。長久はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。）\\nあなたがコントロールする＋１/＋１カウンターが置かれている各クリーチャーは絆魂を持つ。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・クレリック\', \'flavor\': \'「私が歩むすべての場所は、祖先も一緒に歩む。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=388080&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bbd074af-de90-4aab-9c89-487e464400ad\', \'multiverseId\': 388080}, \'multiverseid\': 388080}, {\'name\': \'아브잔 전투 사제\', \'text\': \'버티기 {W} ({W}, {T}: 이 생물에 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 올려놓는다. 당신은 집중마법을 발동할 수 있는 시기에만 버티기를 활성화할 수 있다.)\\n당신이 조종하는 생물 중 +1/+1 카운터를 가진 각 생물은 생명연결을 가진다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 성직자\', \'flavor\': \'"내가 가는 길에는 조상님들께서 함께 하신다."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=388349&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6971e5a1-af33-425e-9564-396d726a1071\', \'multiverseId\': 388349}, \'multiverseid\': 388349}, {\'name\': \'Sacerdote de Batalha Abzan\', \'text\': \'Sobreviver {W} ({W}, {T}: Coloque um marcador +1/+1 nesta criatura. Use sobreviver somente como um feitiço.)\\nCada criatura que você controla com um marcador +1/+1 tem vínculo com a vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Clérigo\', \'flavor\': \'"Onde quer que eu caminhe, os ancestrais caminham também."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=388618&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e2dcd5a-2e40-491a-ad21-f387eebb30de\', \'multiverseId\': 388618}, \'multiverseid\': 388618}, {\'name\': \'Абзанский Боевой Жрец\', \'text\': \'Стойкость {W} ({W}, {T}: положите один жетон +1/+1 на это существо. Используйте Стойкость только как волшебство.)\\nКаждое существо под вашим контролем, на котором есть жетон +1/+1, имеет Цепь жизни.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Священник\', \'flavor\': \'«Где бы я ни шел, со мной идут предки».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=388887&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6212a7d9-0a31-4568-a5d7-ce1b13d3dbae\', \'multiverseId\': 388887}, \'multiverseid\': 388887}, {\'name\': \'阿布赞战斗僧侣\', \'text\': \'延生{W}（{W}，{T}：在此生物上放置一个+1/+1指示物。延生的时机视同法术。）\\n每个由你操控且其上有+1/+1指示物的生物均具有系命异能。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／僧侣\', \'flavor\': \'「不论我去向何方，先祖都与我同在。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=386735&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b4973bfa-5a39-461d-8858-0044b1e7ecf6\', \'multiverseId\': 386735}, \'multiverseid\': 386735}, {\'name\': \'阿布贊戰鬥僧侶\', \'text\': \'延生{W}（{W}，{T}：在此生物上放置一個+1/+1指示物。延生的時機視同巫術。）\\n每個由你操控且其上有+1/+1指示物的生物均具有繫命異能。\', \'type\': \'生物～人類／僧侶\', \'flavor\': \'「不論我去向何方，先祖都與我同在。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=387004&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'56d335c0-ce1c-4fcf-a787-d134b033e35d\', \'multiverseId\': 387004}, \'multiverseid\': 387004}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ainok-Schwurbruder\', \'text\': \'Standhaft {1}{W} ({1}{W}, {T}: Lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf diese Kreatur. Spiele Standhaft wie eine Hexerei.)\\nJede Kreatur, die du kontrollierst und auf der mindestens eine +1/+1-Marke liegt, hat Erstschlag.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Hund, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'„Haltet die Stellung, für die Familie und die Gefallenen!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=387278&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'39caa779-f555-442b-bcf2-1f2bdf3d7e71\', \'multiverseId\': 387278}, \'multiverseid\': 387278}, {\'name\': \'Ainok unido por la fe\', \'text\': \'Supervivencia {1}{W}. ({1}{W}, {T}: Pon un contador +1/+1 sobre esta criatura. Activa la habilidad de supervivencia solo como un conjuro.)\\nCada criatura que controlas con un contador +1/+1 sobre ella tiene la habilidad de dañar primero.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado perro\', \'flavor\': \'"¡Mantengan la formación, por la familia y los caídos!".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=389161&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d96196f8-cf26-489a-b9b2-0346b81193bb\', \'multiverseId\': 389161}, \'multiverseid\': 389161}, {\'name\': "Frère d\'armes aïnok", \'text\': "Résilience {1}{W} ({1}{W}, {T} : Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur cette créature. N\'utilisez la résilience que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.)\\nChaque créature que vous contrôlez avec un marqueur +1/+1 sur elle a l\'initiative.", \'type\': \'Créature : chien de chasse et soldat\', \'flavor\': \'« Tenez la position, au nom de la famille et de ceux qui ont péri ! »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=387547&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5da2a2da-c7d1-48b3-b35d-2b29701c7194\', \'multiverseId\': 387547}, \'multiverseid\': 387547}, {\'name\': "Ainok Fratello d\'Onore", \'text\': \'Perdurare {1}{W} ({1}{W}, {T}: Metti un segnalino +1/+1 su questa creatura. Perdura solo quando potresti lanciare una stregoneria.)\\nOgni creatura con un segnalino +1/+1 che controlli ha attacco improvviso.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Segugio\', \'flavor\': \'"Serrate i ranghi, per la famiglia e per i caduti!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=387816&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'948a9503-773c-4b96-8590-e4cb0ccbe50b\', \'multiverseId\': 387816}, \'multiverseid\': 387816}, {\'name\': \'アイノクの盟族\', \'text\': \'長久{1}{W}（{1}{W}, {T}：このクリーチャーの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。長久はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。）\\nあなたがコントロールする＋１/＋１カウンターが置かれている各クリーチャーは先制攻撃を持つ。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 猟犬・兵士\', \'flavor\': \'「家族や倒れた者たちのため、この戦線を維持せよ！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=388085&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8304ca84-6316-4317-a674-bd477ec68b8f\', \'multiverseId\': 388085}, \'multiverseid\': 388085}, {\'name\': \'아이녹 의형제\', \'text\': \'버티기 {1}{W} ({1}{W}, {T}: 이 생물에 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 올려놓는다. 당신은 집중마법을 발동할 수 있는 시기에만 버티기를 활성화할 수 있다.)\\n당신이 조종하는 생물 중 +1/+1 카운터를 가진 각 생물은 선제공격을 가진다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 사냥개 병사\', \'flavor\': \'"가족과 전사자들을 위해 전선을 사수하라!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=388354&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a1314cd2-ce81-43bc-93ec-f28e19265c63\', \'multiverseId\': 388354}, \'multiverseid\': 388354}, {\'name\': \'Ainok Laço-de-honra\', \'text\': \'Sobreviver {1}{W} ({1}{W}, {T}: Coloque um marcador +1/+1 nesta criatura. Use sobreviver somente como um feitiço.)\\nCada criatura que você controla com um marcador +1/+1 tem iniciativa.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Sabujo Soldado\', \'flavor\': \'"Mantenham-se firmes, pela sua família e pelos que morreram!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=388623&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f34889de-71e5-40d5-a800-f311c319d082\', \'multiverseId\': 388623}, \'multiverseid\': 388623}, {\'name\': \'Аинок-Побратим\', \'text\': \'Стойкость {1}{W} ({1}{W}, {T}: положите один жетон +1/+1 на это существо. Используйте Стойкость только как волшебство.)\\nКаждое существо под вашим контролем, на котором есть жетон +1/+1, имеет Первый удар.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Пес Солдат\', \'flavor\': \'«Держите строй! Ради семьи и ради павших!»\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=388892&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c5866d6-8d42-46a9-8967-d96d880b2cb7\', \'multiverseId\': 388892}, \'multiverseid\': 388892}, {\'name\': \'义缘犬人\', \'text\': \'延生{1}{W}（{1}{W}，{T}：在此生物上放置一个+1/+1指示物。延生的时机视同法术。）\\n每个由你操控且其上有+1/+1指示物的生物均具有先攻异能。\', \'type\': \'生物～猎犬／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'「坚守战线，为了家族和逝者！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=386740&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'99ea60e8-7772-486a-8921-ac1696c4b3bd\', \'multiverseId\': 386740}, \'multiverseid\': 386740}, {\'name\': \'義緣犬人\', \'text\': \'延生{1}{W}（{1}{W}，{T}：在此生物上放置一個+1/+1指示物。延生的時機視同巫術。）\\n每個由你操控且其上有+1/+1指示物的生物均具有先攻異能。\', \'type\': \'生物～獵犬／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'「堅守戰線，為了家族和逝者！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=387009&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'adc10b32-0d56-44dc-9b2b-367b3369b0f2\', \'multiverseId\': 387009}, \'multiverseid\': 387009}]', "[{'name': 'Ainok-Spurensucher', 'text': 'Erstschlag\\nMorph {4}{R} (Du kannst diese Karte verdeckt für {3} als eine 2/2 Kreatur wirken. Decke sie zu einem beliebigen Zeitpunkt für ihre Morph-Kosten auf.)', 'type': 'Kreatur — Hund, Späher', 'flavor': 'Einige Ainok aus den Bergen genießen als bewährte Jagdgefährten großen Respekt unter den Temur.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=387279&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3a5fd9bc-019d-4840-aacd-8da2a57d0a48', 'multiverseId': 387279}, 'multiverseid': 387279}, {'name': 'Rastreador ainok', 'text': 'Daña primero.\\nMetamorfosis {4}{R}. (Puedes lanzar esta carta boca abajo como una criatura 2/2 pagando {3}. Ponla boca arriba en cualquier momento pagando su coste de metamorfosis.)', 'type': 'Criatura — Explorador perro', 'flavor': 'Algunos Ainok de las montañas son aceptados entre los Temur como fieles compañeros de caza.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=389162&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '64b4baf9-62ac-4519-b05b-bd341b893543', 'multiverseId': 389162}, 'multiverseid': 389162}, {'name': 'Traqueur aïnok', 'text': 'Initiative\\nMue {4}{R} (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte face cachée comme une créature 2/2 pour {3}. Retournez-la à tout moment pour son coût de mue.)', 'type': 'Créature : chien de chasse et éclaireur', 'flavor': 'Certains aïnoks des montagnes sont acceptés par les Temuriens comme compagnons de chasse.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=387548&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ca7ece54-4494-4745-a715-25dd66d45568', 'multiverseId': 387548}, 'multiverseid': 387548}, {'name': 'Ainok Battipista', 'text': 'Attacco improvviso\\nMetamorfosi {4}{R} (Puoi lanciare questa carta a faccia in giù come una creatura 2/2 pagando {3}. Girala a faccia in su in qualsiasi momento pagando il suo costo di metamorfosi.)', 'type': 'Creatura — Esploratore Segugio', 'flavor': 'Alcuni ainok delle montagne vengono accettati tra i Temur come fidati compagni di caccia.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=387817&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e7811435-965d-4658-b125-10cdbee775b5', 'multiverseId': 387817}, 'multiverseid': 387817}, {'name': 'アイノクの足跡追い', 'text': '先制攻撃\\n変異{4}{R}（あなたはこのカードを、{3}で２/２クリーチャーとして裏向きに唱えてもよい。これの変異コストで、これをいつでも表向きにしてよい。）', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 猟犬・スカウト', 'flavor': '山に住むアイノクのなかには、信頼できる狩猟仲間としてティムールに受け入れられた者たちもいる。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=388086&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3887f8f3-0ea8-4df6-b377-bceae2a9f182', 'multiverseId': 388086}, 'multiverseid': 388086}, {'name': '아이녹 추적꾼', 'text': '선제공격\\n변이 {4}{B} (당신은 {3}을 지불해서 이 카드를 뒷면 상태의 2/2 생물로 발동할 수 있다. 언제든지 변이 비용을 지불하고 앞면이 보이도록 뒤집을 수 있다.)', 'type': '생물 — 사냥개 정찰병', 'flavor': '산에서 자란 몇몇 아이녹은 훌륭한 사냥 동반자로서 테무르인들과 함께한다.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=388355&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1c94cd23-dd6e-4113-85ca-d1fe5db6e389', 'multiverseId': 388355}, 'multiverseid': 388355}, {'name': 'Rastreador Ainok', 'text': 'Iniciativa\\nMetamorfose {4}{R} (Você pode conjurar este card com a face voltada para baixo como uma criatura 2/2 por {3}. Volte sua face para cima a qualquer momento pagando seu custo de metamorfose.)', 'type': 'Criatura — Sabujo Batedor', 'flavor': 'Alguns ainoks das montanhas são aceitos pelos Temur como companheiros de caçada confiáveis.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=388624&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6a8933da-156e-46bf-8661-4821aeb9b088', 'multiverseId': 388624}, 'multiverseid': 388624}, {'name': 'Аинок-Следопыт', 'text': 'Первый удар\\nОборотень {4}{R} (Вы можете разыграть эту карту рубашкой вверх как существо 2/2 за {3}. Переверните ее рубашкой вниз в любой момент за ее стоимость Оборотня.)', 'type': 'Существо — Пес Разведчик', 'flavor': 'Иногда горные аиноки становятся для темуров верными товарищами на охоте.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=388893&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5b933438-c736-4952-a5e7-0c704522ac9e', 'multiverseId': 388893}, 'multiverseid': 388893}, {'name': '侦猎犬人', 'text': '先攻\\n变身{4}{R}（你可牌面朝下地施放此牌并支付{3}，将其当成2/2生物。可随时支付其变身费用使其翻回正面。）', 'type': '生物～猎犬／斥候', 'flavor': '铁木尔人将部分山麓犬人当作可靠猎伴。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=386741&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6624cd8e-b860-4e73-8a80-c00834bfb2dc', 'multiverseId': 386741}, 'multiverseid': 386741}, {'name': '偵獵犬人', 'text': '先攻\\n變身{4}{R}（你可牌面朝下地施放此牌並支付{3}，將其當成2/2生物。可隨時支付其變身費用使其翻回正面。）', 'type': '生物～獵犬／斥候', 'flavor': '鐵木爾人將部分山麓犬人當作可靠獵伴。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=387010&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '73a3151f-aeee-4e07-956e-2360c523b21b', 'multiverseId': 387010}, 'multiverseid': 387010}]", '[{\'name\': \'Alabaster-Kirin\', \'text\': \'Fliegend, Wachsamkeit\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Kirin\', \'flavor\': \'Das Erscheinen eines Kirin kündigt das Scheiden oder die Ankunft einer wichtigen Persönlichkeit an. Als sich die Sichtungen herumsprachen, nahm jeder Khan an, es beträfe ihn selbst. Nur der Schamane Chianul dachte an Sarkhan Vol.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=387280&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea9fd103-9cd0-4f87-989b-675d9ed45ce5\', \'multiverseId\': 387280}, \'multiverseid\': 387280}, {\'name\': \'Kirin de alabastro\', \'text\': \'Vuela, vigilancia.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Kirin\', \'flavor\': \'La aparición de un kirin anuncia la muerte o la llegada de una figura importante. Cuando comenzaron a dejarse ver, todos los kans interpretaron que se referían a ellos mismos. Solo el chamán Chianul pensó en Sarkhan Vol.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=389163&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8fae5f04-570d-4437-b206-9751a5785f5e\', \'multiverseId\': 389163}, \'multiverseid\': 389163}, {\'name\': "Kirin d\'albâtre", \'text\': \'Vol, vigilance\', \'type\': \'Créature : kirin\', \'flavor\': "L\'apparition d\'un kirin marque le départ ou l\'arrivée d\'une personne importante. Quand la nouvelle de son apparition se répandit, les khans pensèrent qu\'il venait pour eux. Seul le shamane Chëanul songea à Sarkhan Vol.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=387549&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9c3d7bd4-fc3c-4884-8f04-76da358a626d\', \'multiverseId\': 387549}, \'multiverseid\': 387549}, {\'name\': \'Kirin di Alabastro\', \'text\': \'Volare, cautela\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Kirin\', \'flavor\': "L\'apparizione di un kirin rappresenta la morte o l\'avvento di una personalità importante. Quando gli avvistamenti aumentarono, ogni khan li interpretò come segno del proprio prestigio. Solo lo sciamano Chianul pensò a Sarkhan Vol.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=387818&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bc950532-7276-4aa5-8ba9-6b9e5ab40d84\', \'multiverseId\': 387818}, \'multiverseid\': 387818}, {\'name\': \'雪花石の麒麟\', \'text\': \'飛行、警戒\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 麒麟\', \'flavor\': \'麒麟の出現は、重要な人物の通過または到来を告げる。その目撃の噂が広まるにつれ、すべてのカンたちはそれは自分のことだと受け止めた。それがサルカン・ヴォルであると考えたのは、シャーマンのチアヌルだけであった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=388087&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'63da80b9-8dc9-4579-b2c3-8c39070ff51b\', \'multiverseId\': 388087}, \'multiverseid\': 388087}, {\'name\': \'순백의 기린\', \'text\': \'비행, 경계\', \'type\': \'생물 — 기린\', \'flavor\': \'기린의 등장은 중요한 존재의 소멸이나 도래를 의미한다. 목격담이 퍼지자 칸들은 자신을 뜻하는 것이라고 받아들였다. 오직 주술사 치아눌만이 사르칸 볼을 떠올렸다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=388356&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0880adfe-c874-4c5f-bb1c-7e9610b5b527\', \'multiverseId\': 388356}, \'multiverseid\': 388356}, {\'name\': \'Kirin de Alabastro\', \'text\': \'Voar, vigilância\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Kirin\', \'flavor\': \'A aparição de um kirin significa a passagem ou chegada de uma figura importante. Quando a notícia se espalhou, cada khan achou que era por causa de si. Somente o xamã Chianul pensou em Sarkhan Vol.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=388625&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b3c59484-701f-4bd7-a7f5-43aead936ccb\', \'multiverseId\': 388625}, \'multiverseid\': 388625}, {\'name\': \'Алебастровый Кирин\', \'text\': \'Полет, Бдительность\', \'type\': \'Существо — Кирин\', \'flavor\': \'Явление кирина говорит об уходе или о появлении кого-то, кто сыграет важную роль в судьбе мира. Когда весть о кирине разнеслась, каждый из ханов отнес это на свой счет. Лишь шаман Чианул подумал о Сархане Воле.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=388894&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'113dfa46-60a7-4f1c-b3ec-88f88a165747\', \'multiverseId\': 388894}, \'multiverseid\': 388894}, {\'name\': \'圣洁麒麟\', \'text\': \'飞行，警戒\', \'type\': \'生物～麒麟\', \'flavor\': \'麒麟现身，预示有伟人降世或离逝。自从目见麒麟的消息传开，五位可汗都认为这位伟人就是自己。只有祭师恰努尔想到了萨坎沃。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=386742&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'95c50559-9319-4371-ad8e-9b6c002f462c\', \'multiverseId\': 386742}, \'multiverseid\': 386742}, {\'name\': \'聖潔麒麟\', \'text\': \'飛行，警戒\', \'type\': \'生物～麒麟\', \'flavor\': \'麒麟現身，預示有偉人降世或離逝。自從目睹麒麟的消息傳開，五位可汗都認為這位偉人就是自己。只有祭師恰努爾想到了薩坎沃。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=387011&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c609bdc-c08e-4651-b8b1-c568d4f20d71\', \'multiverseId\': 387011}, \'multiverseid\': 387011}]', '[{\'name\': \'Alpiner Grizzly\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Bär\', \'flavor\': \'Die Temur heißen Bären im Klan willkommen und kämpfen an ihrer Seite. Diese Verbindung geht auf Zeiten zurück, als sie sich Seite an Seite unter der Herrschaft der Sultai plagten.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=387281&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f991931-9a99-47ed-8c40-e1b68d2cd2fb\', \'multiverseId\': 387281}, \'multiverseid\': 387281}, {\'name\': \'Parda alpina\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Oso\', \'flavor\': \'Los Temur acogen a los osos en su clan y luchan junto a ellos en la batalla. La relación se remonta a cuando ambas especies hacían trabajos forzados codo con codo bajo el yugo de los Sultai.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=389164&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'66185c5d-af56-40f1-bb83-1a7f0e111d01\', \'multiverseId\': 389164}, \'multiverseid\': 389164}, {\'name\': \'Grizzly alpin\', \'type\': \'Créature : ours\', \'flavor\': "Les Temur accueillent les ours dans leur clan et combattent à leurs côtés. Cette entente remonte à l\'époque où ils vivaient sous le joug des Sultaï.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=387550&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b6e7809d-c0da-4cf8-89c2-9bf7ccf78128\', \'multiverseId\': 387550}, \'multiverseid\': 387550}, {\'name\': \'Grizzly Alpina\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Orso\', \'flavor\': \'I Temur accolgono gli orsi nel clan e combattono al loro fianco in battaglia. Questa vicinanza risale al tempo in cui soffrivano insieme sotto il dominio dei Sultai.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=387819&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2650b328-6276-4715-b480-e750c8da1951\', \'multiverseId\': 387819}, \'multiverseid\': 387819}, {\'name\': \'高山の灰色熊\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 熊\', \'flavor\': \'ティムールは熊を部族の一員として喜んで迎え、戦闘で共に並んで戦う。その絆は、かつてスゥルタイの支配下で共に並んで労役に従事していた時代に結ばれたと言われている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=388088&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eda242ee-e21b-4c72-8b06-4b9a15406e9a\', \'multiverseId\': 388088}, \'multiverseid\': 388088}, {\'name\': \'고산지대 회색곰\', \'type\': \'생물 — 곰\', \'flavor\': \'테무르인들은 곰과 친밀하다. 전투에서도 함께하는 이들의 관계는 술타이의 통치 아래서 나란히 노동하던 시절로 거슬러 올라간다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=388357&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'63f20c40-ce46-43fb-9bf3-831d0e2acb5e\', \'multiverseId\': 388357}, \'multiverseid\': 388357}, {\'name\': \'Urso Pardo Alpino\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Urso\', \'flavor\': \'Os Temur aceitam os ursos em seu clã, lutando ao lado deles na batalha. A relação data do tempo em que eles trabalhavam lado a lado sob o domínio Sultai.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=388626&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e03fe9a-8b8e-492c-8149-6ceaecca70f1\', \'multiverseId\': 388626}, \'multiverseid\': 388626}, {\'name\': \'Горный Гризли\', \'type\': \'Существо — Медведь\', \'flavor\': \'Темуры с готовностью принимают в свой клан медведей, которые бок о бок сражаются с ними в битвах. Эта дружба уходит корнями в те времена, когда они вместе гнули спину под властью султайцев.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=388895&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ae103f5f-b560-482e-b88b-cfbe44294dfa\', \'multiverseId\': 388895}, \'multiverseid\': 388895}, {\'name\': \'高山灰熊\', \'type\': \'生物～熊\', \'flavor\': \'铁木尔欢迎熊加入部落一同并肩作战。他们的关系可以追溯到他们一起在苏勒台统治下做苦工的日子。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=386743&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea2e21c9-82e7-4a66-a5ca-567e99f44feb\', \'multiverseId\': 386743}, \'multiverseid\': 386743}, {\'name\': \'高山灰熊\', \'type\': \'生物～熊\', \'flavor\': \'鐵木爾歡迎熊加入部落一同並肩作戰。他們的關係可以追溯到他們一起在蘇勒台統治下做苦工的日子。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=387012&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'04d2a00d-96ad-408e-962f-5799088161a8\', \'multiverseId\': 387012}, \'multiverseid\': 387012}]', '[{\'name\': \'Altar der Brut\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine andere bleibende Karte unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, legt jeder Gegner die oberste Karte seiner Bibliothek auf seinen Friedhof.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Bittsteller bringen Fleisch und Silber, Blumen und Blut. Der Altar nimmt sich, was er will, mit glühenden Augen voller Verheißung.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=387282&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'71a8d0b0-9b98-475e-87ec-bf6fc53e8168\', \'multiverseId\': 387282}, \'multiverseid\': 387282}, {\'name\': \'Altar de la progenie\', \'text\': \'Siempre que otro permanente entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, cada oponente pone la primera carta de su biblioteca en su cementerio.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Los suplicantes ofrecen carne y plata, flores y sangre. El altar toma lo que desea y sus ojos brillan con promesas mudas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=389165&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e597fa20-9337-4f97-a18b-4a0215f9f1ba\', \'multiverseId\': 389165}, \'multiverseid\': 389165}, {\'name\': \'Autel de la Couvée\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'un autre permanent arrive le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, chaque adversaire met la carte du dessus de sa bibliothèque dans son cimetière.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "Les quémandeurs déposent de la chair et de l\'argent, des fleurs et du sang. L\'autel prend ce qui lui convient, les yeux luisants de promesses inexprimées.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=387551&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b9056a58-cf00-4424-bd0c-b2bf34341d54\', \'multiverseId\': 387551}, \'multiverseid\': 387551}, {\'name\': \'Altare della Nidiata\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta un altro permanente entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, ogni avversario mette nel proprio cimitero la prima carta del proprio grimorio.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': "I supplici offrono carne e argento, fiori e sangue. L\'altare accetta ciò che predilige, i suoi occhi splendenti di promesse silenziose.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=387820&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4006f702-6d10-466d-9416-dc6f0288f2de\', \'multiverseId\': 387820}, \'multiverseid\': 387820}, {\'name\': \'群の祭壇\', \'text\': \'他のパーマネントが１つあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、各対戦相手はそれぞれ自分のライブラリーの一番上のカードを自分の墓地に置く。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'嘆願者は肉や銀や花や血を奉納する。祭壇は望むものを取り、その目は語られざる約束で輝きを放っている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=388089&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'16fe4b5b-2339-4783-8625-308fe200501c\', \'multiverseId\': 388089}, \'multiverseid\': 388089}, {\'name\': \'군락의 제단\', \'text\': \'당신의 조종하에 다른 지속물이 전장에 들어올 때마다, 각 상대는 자신의 서고 맨 위의 카드 한 장을 자신의 무덤에 넣는다.\', \'type\': \'마법물체\', \'flavor\': \'집행자는 살점과 은, 꽃, 피를 바친다. 제단은 말없이 약속하는 눈빛을 발하며 원하는 제물을 취한다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=388358&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'700c2894-9968-400c-b4d7-ab5d68e74223\', \'multiverseId\': 388358}, \'multiverseid\': 388358}, {\'name\': \'Altar da Linhagem\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que outra permanente entra no campo de batalha sob o seu controle, cada oponente coloca o card do topo do grimório dele no próprio cemitério.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'Os suplicantes oferecem carne e prata, flores e sangue. O altar recebe o que quer, seus olhos brilhando com promessas veladas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=388627&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'42f60c00-cd57-44c9-958c-da2982814d52\', \'multiverseId\': 388627}, \'multiverseid\': 388627}, {\'name\': \'Алтарь Выводка\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда другой перманент выходит на поле битвы под вашим контролем, каждый оппонент кладет верхнюю карту своей библиотеки на свое кладбище.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'Просители приносят плоть и серебро, цветы и кровь. Алтарь принимает то, что ему угодно, и его глаза сияют невысказанными обещаниями.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=388896&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'94cebf00-41c9-40d7-a299-aebe4e219c5a\', \'multiverseId\': 388896}, \'multiverseid\': 388896}, {\'name\': \'族群祭坛\', \'text\': \'每当另一个永久物在你的操控下进战场时，每位对手各将其牌库顶牌置入其坟墓场。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'祈求者献上鲜肉与白银、鲜花和血液。祭坛取走它想要的，眼睛闪烁着不成文的诺言。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=386744&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5909de80-bc08-44bc-9b2b-a8b97e434c6f\', \'multiverseId\': 386744}, \'multiverseid\': 386744}, {\'name\': \'族群祭壇\', \'text\': \'每當另一個永久物在你的操控下進戰場時，每位對手各將其牌庫頂牌置入其墳墓場。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'祈求者獻上鮮肉與白銀、鮮花和血液。祭壇取走它想要的，眼睛閃爍著不成文的諾言。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=387013&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'10caba2b-9c0e-46bf-9fe4-a795657413d9\', \'multiverseId\': 387013}, \'multiverseid\': 387013}]', '[{\'name\': \'Anafenza die Vorderste\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn Anafenza die Vorderste angreift, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf eine andere getappte Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst.\\nFalls eine Kreaturenkarte von irgendwoher auf den Friedhof eines Gegners gelegt würde, schicke sie stattdessen ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'Statt müßig auf dem Bernsteinthron zu sitzen, führt Anafenza die Häuser der Abzan in die Schlacht.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=387283&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c241243-c2eb-4b7a-b90b-adf80a5d8c6f\', \'multiverseId\': 387283}, \'multiverseid\': 387283}, {\'name\': \'Anafenza, la líder\', \'text\': \'Siempre que Anafenza, la líder ataque, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre otra criatura objetivo girada que controlas.\\nSi una carta de criatura fuera a ir al cementerio de un oponente desde cualquier parte, en vez de eso, exíliala.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Soldado humano\', \'flavor\': \'Anafenza, que rara vez reposa en el trono de ámbar, siempre lidera a las dinastías abzanas en la batalla.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=389166&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd8623a3-6d46-4758-a466-230e963b9459\', \'multiverseId\': 389166}, \'multiverseid\': 389166}, {\'name\': \'Anafenza, la Primordiale\', \'text\': "Quand Anafenza, la Primordiale attaque, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur une autre créature ciblée engagée que vous contrôlez.\\nSi une carte de créature devait être mise dans le cimetière d\'un adversaire d\'où qu\'elle vienne, exilez-la à la place.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et soldat\', \'flavor\': "Rarement assise sur le Trône d\'ambre, Anafenza mène toujours les Maisons abzanes au combat.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=387552&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a4900f96-92e2-4836-b6c2-dd7f64d63dbb\', \'multiverseId\': 387552}, \'multiverseid\': 387552}, {\'name\': \'Anafenza, la Preminente\', \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta Anafenza, la Preminente attacca, metti un segnalino +1/+1 su un\'altra creatura TAPpata bersaglio che controlli.\\nSe una carta creatura sta per essere messa nel cimitero di un avversario da qualsiasi zona, invece esiliala.", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Soldato Umano\', \'flavor\': "Di rado seduta sul Trono d\'Ambra, Anafenza guida sempre le Casate Abzan in battaglia.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=387821&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fe0ba956-635d-4798-96c7-e1d178b1a6ac\', \'multiverseId\': 387821}, \'multiverseid\': 387821}, {\'name\': \'先頭に立つもの、アナフェンザ\', \'text\': \'先頭に立つもの、アナフェンザが攻撃するたび、あなたがコントロールする他のタップ状態のクリーチャー１体を対象とする。それの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。\\nクリーチャー・カードがいずれかの領域から対戦相手の墓地に置かれるなら、代わりにそれを追放する。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・兵士\', \'flavor\': \'琥珀の玉座で鎮座していることが滅多にないアナフェンザは、常に戦いでアブザン家を率いている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=388090&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9df1b92e-ba98-4a6a-8ee6-0a14b3269e15\', \'multiverseId\': 388090}, \'multiverseid\': 388090}, {\'name\': \'일인자 아나펜자\', \'text\': \'일인자 아나펜자가 공격할 때마다, 당신이 조종하는 다른 탭된 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물에 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 올려놓는다.\\n생물 카드가 어디서든 상대의 무덤에 들어가려고 하면, 대신에 그 카드를 추방한다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 생물 — 인간 병사\', \'flavor\': \'호박 왕좌에 앉아 쉴 날이 없는 아나펜자는 항상 아브잔 일족을 전투로 이끈다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=388359&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2ec1d47f-dc2f-432b-ae26-46081e0fbf15\', \'multiverseId\': 388359}, \'multiverseid\': 388359}, {\'name\': \'Anafenza, a Principal\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que Anafenza, a Principal, atacar, coloque um marcador +1/+1 em outra criatura alvo virada sob seu controle.\\nSe um card de criatura for ser colocado no cemitério de um oponente vindo de qualquer lugar, em vez disso, exile-o.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Humano Soldado\', \'flavor\': \'Os momentos de tranquilidade de Anafenza no Trono Âmbar são raros, pois ela sempre lidera as Dinastias Abzan na batalha.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=388628&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1c51f50b-2d9e-498e-8d4a-845becdbb92f\', \'multiverseId\': 388628}, \'multiverseid\': 388628}, {\'name\': \'Анафенза, Первейшая\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда Анафенза, Первейшая атакует, положите один жетон +1/+1 на другое целевое повернутое существо под вашим контролем.\\nЕсли карта существа должна попасть откуда-либо на кладбище оппонента, изгоните ее вместо этого.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Человек Солдат\', \'flavor\': \'Анафензу редко можно застать на Янтарном троне. Она сама ведет Семьи Абзана в битвы.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=388897&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'22e3ec1d-72d0-4135-bfdf-0f5d76c9e5a1\', \'multiverseId\': 388897}, \'multiverseid\': 388897}, {\'name\': \'首领阿娜芬札\', \'text\': \'每当首领阿娜芬札攻击时，在另一个目标由你操控且已横置的生物上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\\n如果任一生物牌将从任何区域置入对手的坟墓场，则改为将它放逐。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物～人类／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'阿娜芬札常年亲率阿布赞眷族南征北战，从未流连帐中琥珀宝座。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=386745&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c356f559-52a6-44d6-ad42-e8e61e61f1e7\', \'multiverseId\': 386745}, \'multiverseid\': 386745}, {\'name\': \'首領阿娜芬札\', \'text\': \'每當首領阿娜芬札攻擊時，在另一個目標由你操控且已橫置的生物上放置一個+1/+1指示物。\\n如果任一生物牌將從任何區域置入對手的墳墓場，則改為將它放逐。\', \'type\': \'傳奇生物～人類／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'阿娜芬札常年親率阿布贊眷族南征北戰，從未流連帳中琥珀寶座。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=387014&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f734220d-3cc7-4939-9a92-7c074ee8fcd3\', \'multiverseId\': 387014}, \'multiverseid\': 387014}]', '[{\'name\': \'Anführer der Schuppe\', \'text\': \'Andere Krieger-Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +0/+1.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'"Wir sind der ungebrochene Schild. Sollten wir heute fallen, sterben wir gut und unsere Bäume werden unsere Namen in Ehren tragen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=387312&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'50e3c8c9-8e2d-434b-b92a-37eead1b31b1\', \'multiverseId\': 387312}, \'multiverseid\': 387312}, {\'name\': \'Jefe de la escama\', \'text\': \'Las otras criaturas Guerrero que controlas obtienen +0/+1.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Somos el escudo incólume. Si caemos hoy, será una buena muerte y nuestros árboles portarán nuestros nombres con honor".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=389195&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb7f432b-8e9e-4b36-858c-08117fef25b6\', \'multiverseId\': 389195}, \'multiverseid\': 389195}, {\'name\': "Chef de l\'Écaille", \'text\': \'Les autres créatures Guerrier que vous contrôlez gagnent +0/+1.\', \'type\': \'Créature : humain et guerrier\', \'flavor\': "« Nous sommes le bouclier intact. Si nous tombons aujourd\'hui, nous mourrons avec honneur et nos arbres porteront fièrement nos noms. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=387581&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fbf1d975-c7f8-41b9-9c6c-3289a82d1b3a\', \'multiverseId\': 387581}, \'multiverseid\': 387581}, {\'name\': \'Condottiero della Scaglia\', \'text\': \'Le altre creature Guerriero che controlli prendono +0/+1.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Siamo lo scudo intatto. Se cadremo oggi, saremo morti rettamente e i nostri alberi mostreranno con onore i nostri nomi."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=387850&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d90508db-d51c-44a9-ab3c-cebed1df483e\', \'multiverseId\': 387850}, \'multiverseid\': 387850}, {\'name\': \'鱗の隊長\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールする他の戦士・クリーチャーは＋０/＋１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'「我々は鉄壁の守りを誇る盾である。今日ここで倒れる者は、良き最期を迎える者たちである。そしてその者の名前は名誉ある名前として族樹に刻まれるだろう。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=388119&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b7b29e7e-3b70-4d1a-bad0-589e7e758ff0\', \'multiverseId\': 388119}, \'multiverseid\': 388119}, {\'name\': \'갑옷의 달인\', \'text\': \'당신이 조종하는 다른 전사 생물들은 +0/+1을 받는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 전사\', \'flavor\': \'"우리는 부서지지 않는 방패다. 우리가 오늘 쓰러진다면 만족스럽게 죽음을 받아들일 것이며, 나무들은 우리의 이름을 명예롭게 기억할 것이다."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=388388&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8e2e93f2-ad26-4927-be9d-2d6a33d9bbc7\', \'multiverseId\': 388388}, \'multiverseid\': 388388}, {\'name\': \'Chefe da Escama\', \'text\': \'As outras criaturas do tipo Guerreiro que você controla recebem +0/+1.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Nós somos o escudo inquebrável. Se cairmos hoje, morreremos bem e nossas árvores levarão nossos nomes com honra."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=388657&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9de9d541-7df6-41d5-93ba-c6223cac115d\', \'multiverseId\': 388657}, \'multiverseid\': 388657}, {\'name\': \'Вождь Чешуи\', \'text\': \'Другие существа-Воины под вашим контролем получают +0/+1.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Воин\', \'flavor\': \'«Мы — несокрушимый щит. Если мы погибнем сегодня, это будет славная смерть, и наши деревья будут гордо хранить наши имена».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=388926&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f18791a-8457-49cb-9fa7-3b8ef19bf8af\', \'multiverseId\': 388926}, \'multiverseid\': 388926}, {\'name\': \'龙鳞族长\', \'text\': \'由你操控的其他战士生物得+0/+1。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／战士\', \'flavor\': \'「我们的盾牌坚不可摧。如果我们今天阵亡，我们将得到安眠，我们的族树上会光荣地刻上我们的名字。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=386774&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d7a95fb-3416-4696-b0ab-5d75e591312e\', \'multiverseId\': 386774}, \'multiverseid\': 386774}, {\'name\': \'龍鱗族長\', \'text\': \'由你操控的其他戰士生物得+0/+1。\', \'type\': \'生物～人類／戰士\', \'flavor\': \'「我們的盾牌堅不可摧。如果我們今天陣亡，我們將得到安眠，我們的族樹上會光榮地刻上我們的名字。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=387043&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d5c2b172-d7da-4a7a-b61a-b0789bf566e6\', \'multiverseId\': 387043}, \'multiverseid\': 387043}]', '[{\'name\': \'Anführerin der Klinge\', \'text\': \'Andere Krieger-Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +1/+0.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'„Wir sind die Flinken, die Starken, der gellende Schrei der Klinge! Fürchtet nichts und greift an!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=387311&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dda9f1d7-3257-4729-a038-03e86054b649\', \'multiverseId\': 387311}, \'multiverseid\': 387311}, {\'name\': \'Jefe del filo\', \'text\': \'Las otras criaturas Guerrero que controlas obtienen +1/+0.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero humano\', \'flavor\': \'"¡Somos el veloz, fuerte y cortante alarido de la cuchilla! ¡Nada teman, y ataquen!".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=389194&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'535664a6-7090-4c6e-81b9-84ff17c27024\', \'multiverseId\': 389194}, \'multiverseid\': 389194}, {\'name\': \'Chef du Tranchant\', \'text\': \'Les autres créatures Guerrier que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+0.\', \'type\': \'Créature : humain et guerrier\', \'flavor\': "« Vifs et puissants, nous sommes le cri tranchant de la lame ! N\'ayez peur de rien et frappez ! »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=387580&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6466648a-e871-4c02-9744-c2ba3c35c2d1\', \'multiverseId\': 387580}, \'multiverseid\': 387580}, {\'name\': \'Condottiera del Filo di Lama\', \'text\': \'Le altre creature Guerriero che controlli prendono +1/+0.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Siamo rapidi, siamo potenti, siamo il grido affilato della lama! Non abbiate timore di nulla e attaccate!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=387849&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6cff6630-48c2-4eb0-8e55-d8a34abb45f2\', \'multiverseId\': 387849}, \'multiverseid\': 387849}, {\'name\': \'刃の隊長\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールする他の戦士・クリーチャーは＋１/＋０の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'「我々は速く、強く、刃が空を切る音も鋭い。恐れるな！ためらわず一撃を繰り出せ！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=388118&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f0c9c557-0643-4f1e-ae8b-97f8a850a7f6\', \'multiverseId\': 388118}, \'multiverseid\': 388118}, {\'name\': \'칼의 달인\', \'text\': \'당신이 조종하는 다른 전사 생물들은 +1/+0을 받는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 전사\', \'flavor\': \'"우리는 빠르고 강력하며 예리한 비명을 지르는 검이다! 두려워 말고 공격하라!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=388387&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'633f0822-bae5-4dfb-a3b0-cff615784e49\', \'multiverseId\': 388387}, \'multiverseid\': 388387}, {\'name\': \'Chefe do Gume\', \'text\': \'As outras criaturas do tipo Guerreiro que você controla recebem +1/+0.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Nós somos a velocidade, a força, o grito agudo da lâmina! Não temam nada e ataquem!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=388656&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a34a2465-1856-43c6-8399-5aa12db5d243\', \'multiverseId\': 388656}, \'multiverseid\': 388656}, {\'name\': \'Вождь Лезвия\', \'text\': \'Другие существа-Воины под вашим контролем получают +1/+0.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Воин\', \'flavor\': \'«Мы сильны и стремительны, как резкий свист клинка! Не бойтесь ничего и бейте!»\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=388925&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'232ef6e5-d697-456e-a692-3908613ea42b\', \'multiverseId\': 388925}, \'multiverseid\': 388925}, {\'name\': \'刃锋族长\', \'text\': \'由你操控的其他战士生物得+1/+0。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／战士\', \'flavor\': \'「我们行动迅捷，力量强壮，手中利刃呼啸！无所畏惧，勇往直前！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=386773&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'abfb378b-2ccc-4b87-bafe-f93ac7297d32\', \'multiverseId\': 386773}, \'multiverseid\': 386773}, {\'name\': \'刃鋒族長\', \'text\': \'由你操控的其他戰士生物得+1/+0。\', \'type\': \'生物～人類／戰士\', \'flavor\': \'「我們行動迅捷，力量強壯，手中利刃呼嘯！無所畏懼，勇往直前！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=387042&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c95b0ab2-c226-4846-ad35-9211123376cf\', \'multiverseId\': 387042}, \'multiverseid\': 387042}]', '[{\'name\': \'Anrufung des Sippenbaums\', \'text\': \'Bringe einen X/X schwarzen und grünen (Geist, Krieger)-Kreaturenspielstein ins Spiel, wobei X die höchste Widerstandskraft unter den Kreaturen ist, die du kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Die vergehenden Jahre fügen dem Baumstamm neue Ringe hinzu und stärken so die Geister, die darin hausen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=387390&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5282cb67-6e91-48db-b670-dc6e133ea9ff\', \'multiverseId\': 387390}, \'multiverseid\': 387390}, {\'name\': \'Invocación del árbol familiar\', \'text\': \'Pon en el campo de batalla una ficha de criatura Guerrero Espíritu negra y verde X/X, donde X es la mayor resistencia entre las criaturas que controlas.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'El paso de los años agrega anillos al tronco del árbol y fortalece a los espíritus que habitan en su interior.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=389273&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'74ea60cb-52d9-4ce7-b9a5-6cf2b1bb1684\', \'multiverseId\': 389273}, \'multiverseid\': 389273}, {\'name\': "Invocation de l\'arbre-parent", \'text\': "Mettez sur le champ de bataille un jeton de créature X/X verte et noire Esprit et Guerrier, X étant l\'endurance la plus élevée parmi les créatures que vous contrôlez.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Chaque nouvelle année ajoute son cerne au tronc de l\'arbre, renforçant ainsi les esprits qui y demeurent.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=387659&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'739f060a-2eb2-419f-93d2-67d4a24a6c0f\', \'multiverseId\': 387659}, \'multiverseid\': 387659}, {\'name\': "Invocazione dell\'Albero Atavico", \'text\': \'Metti sul campo di battaglia una pedina creatura Guerriero Spirito X/X nera e verde, dove X è la costituzione maggiore tra le creature che controlli.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': "Ogni anno che passa aggiunge un nuovo anello al tronco dell\'albero, potenziando gli spiriti che risiedono al suo interno.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=387928&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11273b6e-2cf1-48aa-9a74-bc873570996b\', \'multiverseId\': 387928}, \'multiverseid\': 387928}, {\'name\': \'族樹の発動\', \'text\': \'黒であり緑であるＸ/Ｘのスピリット・戦士・クリーチャー・トークンを１体戦場に出す。Ｘはあなたがコントロールするクリーチャーの中で最大のタフネスの値に等しい。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'過ぎゆく年月が木の幹に新たな年輪を加え、内に住む魂をより強化する。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=388197&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'78183575-bf43-446b-ad3e-d54ee6651147\', \'multiverseId\': 388197}, \'multiverseid\': 388197}, {\'name\': \'조상나무 부르기\', \'text\': \'X/X 흑색 및 녹색 신령 전사 생물 토큰 한 개를 전장에 놓는다. X는 당신이 조종하는 생물 중 방어력이 제일 높은 생물의 방어력이다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'세월이 흘러 나무에 나이테가 한 줄 더 생기면, 그 나무에 깃든 신령도 강력해진다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=388466&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc482f40-c79d-46a8-ab76-c422589727a5\', \'multiverseId\': 388466}, \'multiverseid\': 388466}, {\'name\': \'Invocação da Árvore de Família\', \'text\': \'Coloque no campo de batalha uma ficha de criatura preta e verde X/X do tipo Espírito Guerreiro, sendo X a maior resistência entre as criaturas que você controla.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'O passar dos anos adiciona novos anéis ao tronco das árvores, dando força aos espíritos que nelas habitam.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=388735&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'438b8411-1c83-4ce3-902d-e656c2a37999\', \'multiverseId\': 388735}, \'multiverseid\': 388735}, {\'name\': \'Заклятье Древа Родства\', \'text\': \'Положите на поле битвы одну фишку существа X/X черный и зеленый Дух Воин, где X — наибольшее значение выносливости среди существ под вашим контролем.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Проходящие года добавляют новые кольца к стволу дерева, и это усиливает живущих в нем духов.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=389004&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea11c5dd-a33e-4a0d-930e-c809c2811a8c\', \'multiverseId\': 389004}, \'multiverseid\': 389004}, {\'name\': \'族树祝愿\', \'text\': \'将一个X/X，黑绿双色的精怪／战士衍生生物放进战场，X为由你操控的生物中防御力最大者的数值。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'岁月给族树增加了新的年轮，增强了居住其中的灵魂。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=386852&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3eb637d1-b408-4b3f-91b4-faaf4f6b42f0\', \'multiverseId\': 386852}, \'multiverseid\': 386852}, {\'name\': \'族樹祝願\', \'text\': \'將一個X/X，黑綠雙色的精靈／戰士衍生生物放進戰場，X為由你操控的生物中防禦力最大者的數值。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'歲月給族樹增加了新的年輪，增強了居住其中的靈魂。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=387121&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'25310b3f-546e-499a-80a5-8625de0fd522\', \'multiverseId\': 387121}, \'multiverseid\': 387121}]', "[{'name': 'Aschewolkenphoenix', 'text': 'Fliegend\\nWenn der Aschewolkenphoenix stirbt, bringe ihn verdeckt ins Spiel zurück.\\nMorph {4}{R}{R} (Du kannst diese Karte verdeckt für {3} als eine 2/2 Kreatur wirken. Decke sie zu einem beliebigen Zeitpunkt für ihre Morph-Kosten auf.)\\nWenn der Aschewolkenphoenix aufgedeckt wird, fügt er jedem Spieler 2 Schadenspunkte zu.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Phoenix', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=387289&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5f984cf8-9435-4332-9351-4b3690798ced', 'multiverseId': 387289}, 'multiverseid': 387289}, {'name': 'Fénix nubecinéreo', 'text': 'Vuela.\\nCuando el Fénix nubecinéreo muera, regrésalo al campo de batalla boca abajo.\\nMetamorfosis {4}{R}{R}. (Puedes lanzar esta carta boca abajo como una criatura 2/2 pagando {3}. Ponla boca arriba en cualquier momento pagando su coste de metamorfosis.)\\nCuando el Fénix nubecinéreo se ponga boca arriba, hace 2 puntos de daño a cada jugador.', 'type': 'Criatura — Fénix', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=389172&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4ebadf39-040f-4447-b73d-63ebe0e5a935', 'multiverseId': 389172}, 'multiverseid': 389172}, {'name': 'Phénix des nuées cendreuses', 'text': 'Vol\\nQuand le Phénix des nuées cendreuses meurt, renvoyez-le sur le champ de bataille face cachée.\\nMue {4}{R}{R} (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte face cachée comme une créature 2/2 pour {3}. Retournez-la à tout moment pour son coût de mue.)\\nQuand le Phénix des nuées cendreuses est retourné face visible, il inflige 2 blessures à chaque joueur.', 'type': 'Créature : phénix', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=387558&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e91127e4-5f55-4ede-b956-4707c0c80bb5', 'multiverseId': 387558}, 'multiverseid': 387558}, {'name': 'Fenice della Nube Cinerea', 'text': 'Volare\\nQuando la Fenice della Nube Cinerea muore, rimettila sul campo di battaglia a faccia in giù.\\nMetamorfosi {4}{R}{R} (Puoi lanciare questa carta a faccia in giù come una creatura 2/2 pagando {3}. Girala a faccia in su in qualsiasi momento pagando il suo costo di metamorfosi.)\\nQuando la Fenice della Nube Cinerea viene girata a faccia in su, infligge 2 danni a ogni giocatore.', 'type': 'Creatura — Fenice', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=387827&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '82bc149f-06fd-400c-b1c8-d47e183de2e5', 'multiverseId': 387827}, 'multiverseid': 387827}, {'name': '灰雲のフェニックス', 'text': '飛行\\n灰雲のフェニックスが死亡したとき、これを裏向きで戦場に戻す。\\n変異{4}{R}{R}（あなたはこのカードを、{3}で２/２クリーチャーとして裏向きに唱えてもよい。これの変異コストで、これをいつでも表向きにしてよい。）\\n灰雲のフェニックスが表向きになったとき、これは各プレイヤーにそれぞれ２点のダメージを与える。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — フェニックス', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=388096&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7af6e369-4fe0-4587-81db-7349160ea0a1', 'multiverseId': 388096}, 'multiverseid': 388096}, {'name': '재구름 불사조', 'text': '비행\\n재구름 불사조가 죽을 때, 그 카드를 뒷면 상태로 전장으로 되돌린다.\\n변이 {4}{R}{R} (당신은 {3}을 지불해서 이 카드를 뒷면 상태의 2/2 생물로 발동할 수 있다. 언제든지 변이 비용을 지불하고 앞면이 보이도록 뒤집을 수 있다.)\\n재구름 불사조가 앞면으로 뒤집히면, 재구름 불사조는 각 플레이어에게 피해 2점을 입힌다.', 'type': '생물 — 불사조', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=388365&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a9685e03-2ca3-4bb0-bd7c-39e04118557a', 'multiverseId': 388365}, 'multiverseid': 388365}, {'name': 'Fênix Nuvem-de-cinzas', 'text': 'Voar\\nQuando Fênix Nuvem-de-cinzas morrer, devolva-a ao campo de batalha voltada para baixo.\\nMetamorfose {4}{R}{R} (Você pode conjurar este card com a face voltada para baixo como uma criatura 2/2 por {3}. Volte sua face para cima a qualquer momento pagando seu custo de metamorfose.)\\nQuando Fênix Nuvem-de-cinzas é voltada para cima, ela causa 2 pontos de dano a cada jogador.', 'type': 'Criatura — Fênix', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=388634&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8448a43f-9017-48cc-8a88-b98bc888d112', 'multiverseId': 388634}, 'multiverseid': 388634}, {'name': 'Феникс Пепельного Облака', 'text': 'Полет\\nКогда Феникс Пепельного Облака умирает, верните его на поле битвы рубашкой вверх.\\nОборотень {4}{R}{R} (Вы можете разыграть эту карту рубашкой вверх как существо 2/2 за {3}. Переверните ее рубашкой вниз в любой момент за ее стоимость Оборотня.)\\nКогда Феникс Пепельного Облака переворачивается рубашкой вниз, он наносит по 2 повреждения каждому игроку.', 'type': 'Существо — Феникс', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=388903&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '19b3aec3-d1dd-4cd1-842c-fb47a8fc262d', 'multiverseId': 388903}, 'multiverseid': 388903}, {'name': '烬云凤凰', 'text': '飞行\\n当烬云凤凰死去时，将它牌面朝下地移回战场。\\n变身{4}{R}{R}（你可牌面朝下地施放此牌并支付{3}，将其当成2/2生物。可随时支付其变身费用使其翻回正面。）\\n当烬云凤凰翻回正面时，它对每位牌手各造成2点伤害。', 'type': '生物～凤凰', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=386751&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4f6531d3-cdfd-41f7-b6ee-42fe078f7451', 'multiverseId': 386751}, 'multiverseid': 386751}, {'name': '燼雲鳳凰', 'text': '飛行\\n當燼雲鳳凰死去時，將它牌面朝下地移回戰場。\\n變身{4}{R}{R}（你可牌面朝下地施放此牌並支付{3}，將其當成2/2生物。可隨時支付其變身費用使其翻回正面。）\\n當燼雲鳳凰翻回正面時，它對每位玩家各造成2點傷害。', 'type': '生物～鳳凰', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=387020&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd4509ce2-0c8c-439a-86cd-c3eb40f70990', 'multiverseId': 387020}, 'multiverseid': 387020}]", '[{\'name\': \'Aus und vorbei\', \'text\': \'Schicke eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl, die kein Land ist, ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich kam auf der Suche nach einer Herausforderung. Alles, was ich fand, warst du." —Zurgo, Khan der Mardu\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=387518&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2a078ea0-3be2-48ce-8711-dba46d879540\', \'multiverseId\': 387518}, \'multiverseid\': 387518}, {\'name\': \'Fin absoluto\', \'text\': \'Exilia el permanente objetivo que no sea tierra.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Vine en busca de un desafío... pero solo te he encontrado a ti". —Zurgo, kan de los Mardu\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=389401&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cc62f0d1-5678-4b54-ad3e-6a38b1b6e51f\', \'multiverseId\': 389401}, \'multiverseid\': 389401}, {\'name\': \'Destruction totale\', \'text\': \'Exilez le permanent non-terrain ciblé.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Je venais en quête de défi. Mais je n\'ai trouvé que toi. » —Zurgo, khan des Mardu", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=387787&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fea2cdf9-0e98-4728-88e4-c11337e3dd09\', \'multiverseId\': 387787}, \'multiverseid\': 387787}, {\'name\': \'Fine Assoluta\', \'text\': \'Esilia un permanente non terra bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Sono giunto in cerca di una sfida, ma non ho trovato che te." —Zurgo, khan dei Mardu\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=388056&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'730c0745-39f6-42f4-b298-55028f460f4d\', \'multiverseId\': 388056}, \'multiverseid\': 388056}, {\'name\': \'完全なる終わり\', \'text\': \'土地でないパーマネント１つを対象とし、それを追放する。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「俺は挑戦を求めて来たというのに。ここにいたのはお前だけというわけか。」 ――マルドゥのカン、ズルゴ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=388325&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'99a5d04c-3bb7-446f-bf0a-81326d2245f5\', \'multiverseId\': 388325}, \'multiverseid\': 388325}, {\'name\': \'정말 끝장\', \'text\': \'대지가 아닌 지속물을 목표로 정한다. 그 지속물을 추방한다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"나는 도전할 상대를 찾아 이곳에 왔다. 내가 찾은 것은 네가 전부다." —마르두의 칸 주르고\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=388594&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6915593a-7c8a-42f0-97f1-0e5987fdaaec\', \'multiverseId\': 388594}, \'multiverseid\': 388594}, {\'name\': \'Fim Absoluto\', \'text\': \'Exile a permanente alvo que não seja terreno.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Eu vim em busca de um desafio. Tudo o que encontrei foi você." — Zurgo, khan dos Mardu\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=388863&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'230f4744-0ebf-42e3-8686-70b1a877edc7\', \'multiverseId\': 388863}, \'multiverseid\': 388863}, {\'name\': \'Окончательная Погибель\', \'text\': \'Изгоните целевой не являющийся землей перманент.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Я пришел, чтобы найти достойного противника. А нашел только тебя». — Зурго, хан Марду\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=389132&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3fe65685-d3b1-4902-ba0d-07078d661e7a\', \'multiverseId\': 389132}, \'multiverseid\': 389132}, {\'name\': \'彻底终结\', \'text\': \'放逐目标非地永久物。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「我来寻求挑战。可我只找到了你。」 ～玛尔都可汗珠高\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=386980&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'94b7ed52-1e8c-4984-82c8-f06f0b0ab073\', \'multiverseId\': 386980}, \'multiverseid\': 386980}, {\'name\': \'徹底終結\', \'text\': \'放逐目標非地永久物。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「我來尋求挑戰。可我只找到了你。」 ～瑪爾都可汗珠高\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=387249&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f50c391-31e1-453f-8d25-6dc7127e6154\', \'multiverseId\': 387249}, \'multiverseid\': 387249}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ausbeute der Plünderer\', \'text\': \'Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +1/+0.\\nImmer wenn ein Krieger, den du kontrollierst, einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, kannst du 1 Lebenspunkt bezahlen. Falls du dies tust, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Zu erobern bedeutet zu essen." —Edikte von Ilagra\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=387437&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d3f7732-4dce-45f4-b5ae-a70a5fc05cdc\', \'multiverseId\': 387437}, \'multiverseid\': 387437}, {\'name\': \'Botín del incursor\', \'text\': \'Las criaturas que controlas obtienen +1/+0.\\nSiempre que un Guerrero que controlas haga daño de combate a un jugador, puedes pagar 1 vida. Si lo haces, roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"Conquistar es comer". —Edictos de Ilagra\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=389320&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0191b1cb-6ada-4d8e-a761-c9006a7e0f4e\', \'multiverseId\': 389320}, \'multiverseid\': 389320}, {\'name\': \'Butin des pillards\', \'text\': "Les créatures que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+0.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'un guerrier que vous contrôlez inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, vous pouvez payer un point de vie. Si vous faites ainsi, piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "« Conquérir, c\'est se nourrir. » —Préceptes d\'Ilagra", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=387706&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'403c38e0-7110-46d2-a946-9a1a939cd590\', \'multiverseId\': 387706}, \'multiverseid\': 387706}, {\'name\': \'Bottino dei Predoni\', \'text\': \'Le creature che controlli prendono +1/+0.\\nOgniqualvolta un Guerriero che controlli infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, puoi pagare 1 punto vita. Se lo fai, pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"Chi conquista, mangia." —Editti di Ilagra\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=387975&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'44299189-a293-4a17-ad3b-2b67172098b7\', \'multiverseId\': 387975}, \'multiverseid\': 387975}, {\'name\': \'略奪者の戦利品\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールするクリーチャーは＋１/＋０の修整を受ける。\\nあなたがコントロールする戦士１体がプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、あなたはライフを１点支払ってもよい。そうしたなら、カードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「征服とは、食べること。」 ――イラグラの布告\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=388244&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7fa69fce-7860-4759-94e0-309edeb026e7\', \'multiverseId\': 388244}, \'multiverseid\': 388244}, {\'name\': \'약탈의 전리품\', \'text\': \'당신이 조종하는 생물들은 +1/+0을 받는다.\\n당신이 조종하는 전사 생물이 플레이어에게 전투피해를 입힐 때마다, 당신은 생명 1점을 지불할 수 있다. 그렇게 한다면, 카드 한 장을 뽑는다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법\', \'flavor\': \'"정복은 식사와 같다." —일라그라의 칙령\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=388513&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0af26138-912b-4bbe-ab5b-b0a21f63ad5e\', \'multiverseId\': 388513}, \'multiverseid\': 388513}, {\'name\': \'Espólio dos Salteadores\', \'text\': \'As criaturas que você controla recebem +1/+0.\\nToda vez que um Guerreiro que você controla causa dano de combate a um jogador, você pode pagar 1 ponto de vida. Se fizer isso, compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"Conquistar é comer." — Éditos de Ilagra\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=388782&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'db2c30a4-e678-4512-a1e6-76047d49d753\', \'multiverseId\': 388782}, \'multiverseid\': 388782}, {\'name\': \'Добыча Налетчиков\', \'text\': \'Существа под вашим контролем получают +1/+0.\\nКаждый раз, когда Воин под вашим контролем наносит боевые повреждения игроку, вы можете заплатить 1 жизнь. Если вы это делаете, возьмите карту.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': \'«Тот, кто побеждает, будет есть». — указы Илагры\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=389051&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b86faffc-e319-415f-b2e5-a772c17e95ab\', \'multiverseId\': 389051}, \'multiverseid\': 389051}, {\'name\': \'突袭斩获\', \'text\': \'由你操控的生物得+1/+0。\\n每当一个由你操控的战士对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，你可以支付1点生命。若你如此作，则抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'「得胜即为果腹。」 ～依拉戈律典\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=386899&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'84af05a3-524f-4041-8d1e-66fc35adb837\', \'multiverseId\': 386899}, \'multiverseid\': 386899}, {\'name\': \'突襲斬獲\', \'text\': \'由你操控的生物得+1/+0。\\n每當一個由你操控的戰士對任一玩家造成戰鬥傷害時，你可以支付1點生命。若你如此作，則抽一張牌。\', \'type\': \'結界\', \'flavor\': \'「得勝即為果腹。」 ～依拉戈律典\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=387168&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9cf2877d-e684-47cc-8f70-4e243b27bde3\', \'multiverseId\': 387168}, \'multiverseid\': 387168}]', '[{\'name\': \'Auslöschung\', \'text\': \'Schicke eine Verzauberung deiner Wahl ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Wahrheit ist schwer genug zu erkennen, geschweige denn zu verstehen. Um Klarheit zu finden, müssen wir uns aller Ablenkung entledigen." —Zogye, wandernder Weiser\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=387340&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'44c1002f-d18e-4247-9650-da6ae0301134\', \'multiverseId\': 387340}, \'multiverseid\': 387340}, {\'name\': \'Borrar\', \'text\': \'Exilia el encantamiento objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Cuesta bastante ver la verdad, y más aún comprenderla. Debemos eliminar todas las distracciones para hallar la claridad". —Zogai, sabio errante\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=389223&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7338c83e-766d-45cd-ab17-826699fa9704\', \'multiverseId\': 389223}, \'multiverseid\': 389223}, {\'name\': \'Effacement\', \'text\': "Exilez l\'enchantement ciblé.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« La vérité est difficile à voir, et bien plus encore à comprendre. Nous devons écarter toute distraction pour atteindre la clairvoyance. » —Zogyê, sage errant\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=387609&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7f459b96-2b00-4cd4-859f-b35128fdaf6f\', \'multiverseId\': 387609}, \'multiverseid\': 387609}, {\'name\': \'Cancellare\', \'text\': \'Esilia un incantesimo bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"La verità è difficile da distinguere e ancor più da comprendere. Dobbiamo rimuovere qualsiasi distrazione per raggiungere la chiarezza." —Zogye, saggio errante\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=387878&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2000e417-d077-45e6-b743-11b20301840a\', \'multiverseId\': 387878}, \'multiverseid\': 387878}, {\'name\': \'消去\', \'text\': \'エンチャント１つを対象とし、それを追放する。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「真理とは理解はおろか、それを見ることさえ困難を極めるもの。清澄を見いだすには、すべての雑念を取り除かねばならない。」 ――放浪の賢者、ゾギャイ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=388147&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0a285e20-ffd4-4ca9-b748-30aba38b62d9\', \'multiverseId\': 388147}, \'multiverseid\': 388147}, {\'name\': \'삭제\', \'text\': \'부여마법을 목표로 정한다. 그 부여마법을 추방한다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"진실에 대한 이해는 고사하고 그 발견조차 어려우니 잡념을 떨쳐내어 명경지수를 찾아야 하느니라." —방랑 현자 조그예이\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=388416&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea3ca6ce-5e08-4a25-a4c5-338494d447b0\', \'multiverseId\': 388416}, \'multiverseid\': 388416}, {\'name\': \'Apagar\', \'text\': \'Exile o encantamento alvo.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"A verdade é difícil de enxergar, quem dirá compreender. É preciso remover todas as distrações para ver com clareza." — Zogye, o sábio andarilho\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=388685&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e70f4b86-4220-4faa-bb93-d313a54c1649\', \'multiverseId\': 388685}, \'multiverseid\': 388685}, {\'name\': \'Стереть\', \'text\': \'Изгоните целевые чары.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Истину нелегко даже увидеть, не то что понять. Мы должны убрать все, что мешает обрести ясность». — Жогай, странствующий мудрец\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=388954&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6be80818-3706-4145-a023-32bd8fd9feaf\', \'multiverseId\': 388954}, \'multiverseid\': 388954}, {\'name\': \'抹消\', \'text\': \'放逐目标结界。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「真相得见亦难，得知更难。吾等必须摒除杂念，才能见其根本。」 ～云游智者邵格\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=386802&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c32633c0-b128-44ab-9550-2dea33c4e05c\', \'multiverseId\': 386802}, \'multiverseid\': 386802}, {\'name\': \'抹消\', \'text\': \'放逐目標結界。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「真相得見亦難，得知更難。吾等必須摒除雜念，才能見其根本。」 ～雲遊智者邵格\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=387071&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3df4aacd-f703-47ad-8a2e-ac76490a1ec2\', \'multiverseId\': 387071}, \'multiverseid\': 387071}]', '[{\'name\': \'Banner der Abzan\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {W}, {B} oder {G}.\\n{W}{B}{G}, {T}, opfere das Banner der Abzan: Ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Stein, um auszuharren, Wurzeln, um sich zu erinnern.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=387272&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a4fdf2c8-2f74-4c15-a676-d8431aa4d57e\', \'multiverseId\': 387272}, \'multiverseid\': 387272}, {\'name\': \'Estandarte abzano\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {W}, {B} o {G} a tu reserva de maná.\\n{W}{B}{G}, {T}, sacrificar el Estandarte abzano: Roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Piedra para perdurar, raíces para recordar.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=389155&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8148143e-c309-46f3-854b-4490d074f6ed\', \'multiverseId\': 389155}, \'multiverseid\': 389155}, {\'name\': "Étendard d\'Abzan", \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {W}, {B} ou {G} à votre réserve.\\n{W}{B}{G}, {T}, sacrifiez l\'Étendard d\'Abzan : Piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': \'La pierre pour la longévité, les racines pour la mémoire.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=387541&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a3dd117-900a-4f92-ae0d-87c032f2f195\', \'multiverseId\': 387541}, \'multiverseid\': 387541}, {\'name\': \'Stendardo Abzan\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {W}, {B} o {G} alla tua riserva di mana.\\n{W}{B}{G}, {T}, Sacrifica lo Stendardo Abzan: Pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'Pietra per resistere, radici per ricordare.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=387810&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4296306e-24a7-45f6-a6e2-031f95f8ab4c\', \'multiverseId\': 387810}, \'multiverseid\': 387810}, {\'name\': \'アブザンの戦旗\', \'text\': \'{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{W}か{B}か{G}を加える。\\n{W}{B}{G}, {T}, アブザンの戦旗を生け贄に捧げる：カードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'石は忍耐、根は記憶。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=388079&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c2152304-8821-4996-8058-d089bddfa6e8\', \'multiverseId\': 388079}, \'multiverseid\': 388079}, {\'name\': \'아브잔 깃발\', \'text\': \'{T}: {W}, {B} 또는 {G}를 당신의 마나풀에 담는다.\\n{W}{B}{G}, {T}, 아브잔 깃발을 희생한다: 카드 한 장을 뽑는다.\', \'type\': \'마법물체\', \'flavor\': \'인내를 위한 돌, 기억을 위한 뿌리.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=388348&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e46a1e7-0544-459f-9e61-d8f2b8b4450e\', \'multiverseId\': 388348}, \'multiverseid\': 388348}, {\'name\': \'Estandarte Abzan\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {W}, {B} ou {G} à sua reserva de mana.\\n{W}{B}{G}, {T}, Sacrifique Estandarte Abzan: Compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'Pedra para durar, raízes para lembrar.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=388617&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e2ef3bf9-8abe-4e16-9982-ac82f2987909\', \'multiverseId\': 388617}, \'multiverseid\': 388617}, {\'name\': \'Знамя Абзана\', \'text\': \'{T}: добавьте {W}, {B} или {G} в ваше хранилище маны.\\n{W}{B}{G}, {T}, пожертвуйте Знамя Абзана: возьмите карту.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'Камень — чтобы выдержать, корни — чтобы помнить.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=388886&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'46b99a4a-d20e-4d03-86dc-a6d9377e7ea1\', \'multiverseId\': 388886}, \'multiverseid\': 388886}, {\'name\': \'阿布赞战旗\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{W}，{B}或{G}到你的法术力池中。\\n{W}{B}{G}，{T}，牺牲阿布赞战旗：抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'以石坚韧，以根记怀。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=386734&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6dcdb953-2d7c-464a-aedb-55261d0e85bf\', \'multiverseId\': 386734}, \'multiverseid\': 386734}, {\'name\': \'阿布贊戰旗\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{W}，{B}或{G}到你的魔法力池中。\\n{W}{B}{G}，{T}，犧牲阿布贊戰旗：抽一張牌。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'以石堅韌，以根記懷。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=387003&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f857ba94-ed44-4ead-9130-6c008b5621cc\', \'multiverseId\': 387003}, \'multiverseid\': 387003}]', '[{\'name\': \'Banner der Jeskai\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {U}, {R} oder {W}.\\n{U}{R}{W}, {T}, opfere das Banner der Jeskai: Ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Disziplin, um durchzuhalten, Scharfblick, um zu entdecken.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=387379&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e0cd1644-1a8e-4ce3-ab7a-4ac0b7ddd18d\', \'multiverseId\': 387379}, \'multiverseid\': 387379}, {\'name\': \'Estandarte jeskai\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {U}, {R} o {W} a tu reserva de maná.\\n{U}{R}{W}, {T}, sacrificar el Estandarte jeskai: Roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Disciplina para perseverar, perspicacia para descubrir.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=389262&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f1cb481-3727-4ef1-97b4-a2798885408b\', \'multiverseId\': 389262}, \'multiverseid\': 389262}, {\'name\': \'Étendard de Jeskaï\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {U}, {R} ou {W} à votre réserve.\\n{U}{R}{W}, {T}, sacrifiez l\'Étendard de Jeskaï : Piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': \'La discipline pour la persévérance, la perspicacité pour le discernement.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=387648&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'81280d22-b583-477e-b883-85ab53a5f6b8\', \'multiverseId\': 387648}, \'multiverseid\': 387648}, {\'name\': \'Stendardo Jeskai\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {U}, {R} o {W} alla tua riserva di mana.\\n{U}{R}{W}, {T}, Sacrifica lo Stendardo Jeskai: Pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'Disciplina per perseverare, intuito per scoprire.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=387917&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'45097e10-6ea6-4f32-ab62-d14ad5fcf288\', \'multiverseId\': 387917}, \'multiverseid\': 387917}, {\'name\': \'ジェスカイの戦旗\', \'text\': \'{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{U}か{R}か{W}を加える。\\n{U}{R}{W}, {T}, ジェスカイの戦旗を生け贄に捧げる：カードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'規律で耐え忍び、洞察で発見。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=388186&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d0f2fe0e-dc39-4568-a4cf-64950748f5a5\', \'multiverseId\': 388186}, \'multiverseid\': 388186}, {\'name\': \'제스카이 깃발\', \'text\': \'{T}: {U}, {R} 또는 {W}를 당신의 마나풀에 담는다.\\n{U}{R}{W}, {T}, 제스카이 깃발을 희생한다: 카드 한 장을 뽑는다.\', \'type\': \'마법물체\', \'flavor\': \'참을성을 위한 수련, 발견을 위한 통찰.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=388455&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5295999f-9e79-44d0-8ec4-36c439089df1\', \'multiverseId\': 388455}, \'multiverseid\': 388455}, {\'name\': \'Estandarte Jeskai\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {U}, {R} ou {W} à sua reserva de mana.\\n{U}{R}{W}, {T}, Sacrifique Estandarte Jeskai: Compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'Disciplina para perseverar, perspicácia para descobrir.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=388724&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7577d5d7-0152-43e8-bee1-59570cfe2680\', \'multiverseId\': 388724}, \'multiverseid\': 388724}, {\'name\': \'Знамя Джеская\', \'text\': \'{T}: добавьте {U}, {R} или {W} в ваше хранилище маны.\\n{U}{R}{W}, {T}, пожертвуйте Знамя Джеская: возьмите карту.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'Дисциплина — чтобы добиваться, озарение — чтобы открывать.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=388993&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4343f109-dcc7-412b-9880-38c2171e5429\', \'multiverseId\': 388993}, \'multiverseid\': 388993}, {\'name\': \'洁斯凯战旗\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{U}，{R}或{W}到你的法术力池中。\\n{U}{R}{W}，{T}，牺牲洁斯凯战旗：抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'以练持恒，以思探索。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=386841&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ee7cd98f-29a4-4c90-bb49-c66a6cb833b1\', \'multiverseId\': 386841}, \'multiverseid\': 386841}, {\'name\': \'潔斯凱戰旗\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{U}，{R}或{W}到你的魔法力池中。\\n{U}{R}{W}，{T}，犧牲潔斯凱戰旗：抽一張牌。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'以練持恆，以思探索。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=387110&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'42356d5f-d3ec-4bf7-b9f3-fd7